<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">Cingthuilawk</book>
  <para style="h">Cingthuilawk</para>
  <para style="toc1">Cingthuilawk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Cingthuilawk</para>
  <para style="mt">Cingthuilawk</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isarel siangpahrang, Devit capa Solomon e cingthuilawknaw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungangnae hoi cangkhainae panue hane hoi thaipanuenae lawk hah thaipanuek hane hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />lungangnae, lannae, lawkcengnae hoi lannae koelah cangkhainae pang hane hoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />kamawngrame kâhruetcuet poe hane hoi, thoundounnaw ni panuenae hoi poukthainae a tawn awh nahanlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tami lungkaang ni a thai navah lungang a kâthap vaiteh, thaipanueknae ka tawn e ni lamthung patue thainae a hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cingthuilawk hoi bangnuenae, lungangnae hoi kâpâvêinae naw thaipanuek nahanlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae teh panuenae kamtawngnae doeh. Hatei, tamipathunaw ni teh lungangnae hoi cingthuinae hah a dudam awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka capa, na pa e pâtunae hah thai nateh, na manu e kâlawk hai pahnawt hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hothateh na lû dawk kamthoupnae sammuem lah awm vaiteh, na lahuen dawk awi e dingyin lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka capa, tamikayonnaw ni na pasawt pawiteh, ngai pouh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai koe tho van haw, tami thei hanelah pawm sei. A khuekhaw awm laipalah yonnae ka tawn hoeh naw hah arulahoi pawm awh sei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sheol patetlah a hring lahoi payawp awh vaiteh, kadungpoung e tangkom dawk ka bawt e patetlah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aphu kaawm e hno pueng la awh vaiteh, lawphno hoi mamae im dawk kawi sak awh sei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaimouh koe kambawng van leih, maimae tangkabom suekâvan sak awh sei ati awh nakunghai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka capa, ahnimouh koe kambawng hanh. Ahnimae lamthung hah roun hanelah kâyawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahnimae khok teh yonnae koe lah a yawng teh, tami thei hanelah a hue a rang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangpatet e tava nakunghai a hmunae koe tamlawk yangda pawiteh, ayawm doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatei, ahnimouh teh amamouh hoi amamouh kâthei hanlah a kâpawp awh teh, amamae hringnae arulahoi ka pawm e lah doeh ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hot patetlah, kamsoumhoehe pungdawnae koe lah kahounlounnaw e hringnae teh, katawnkung hringnae hah a thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungangnae ni a lawi lahoi kacaipounglah a kaw teh, lam tangkuem dawk lawk ceiceikapanglah a oung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami kamkhuengnae koe a oung teh, khopui kâennae longkha koe lawk a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangmouh kamawngramenaw, nâtotouh maw cungkeihoehe kamawngrame hah na lungpataw awh han rah. Kadudamnaw ni, dudamnae dawk a nawm awh teh, tamipathunaw ni panuethainae hah a hmuhma awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kaie yuenae koe kamlang awh, nangmae thung ka muitha ka awi vaiteh, ka lawk hah na panue sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na kaw awh ei, na ngai awh hoeh. Ka kut ka dâw ei, apinihai banglah na pouk awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kâhruetcuet na poe awh e puenghai na hnoun awh teh, na yuenae puenghai buet touh boehai bout na tarawi awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, yawthoenae na kâhmo awh toteh, na panuikhai vaiteh, lungpuennae na kâhmo awh to hai na panuikhai awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Takinae kahlî kathout ni na kanawi awh teh, bongparui ni na parit awh toteh, kângairu temdengnae a tho toteh, na panuikhai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hatnavah, na kaw awh han, hatei, na pato awh mahoeh. Atangcalah na tawng awh han, hatei, na hmawt awh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Panuethainae hah a hmuhma awh teh, BAWIPA taki hane hah na kârawi awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pouknae ka poe e hah ngai awh hoeh, ka yuenae puenghai banglah noutna awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, a hringnuen pawhik hah amamouh ni a ca awh han. A khopouk awh e ni letlang a paha sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kamawngrame ni a phen saknae ni a thei awh vaiteh, lawlulawlei ka panuek laipalah, a onae ni a raphoe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hatei, ka lawk ka tarawi e teh, karoumcalah kho a sak han. Thoenae taket laipalah karoumcalah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka capa, ka lawk hah ngâi nateh, kaie kâpoelawknaw e hah na lungthung vah na pâkuem pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungangnae koe lah na hnâpakeng nateh, na thai panuek nahanelah na lungthin na poe pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kapek thai nahanelah na kaw teh, thaipanueknae tawn hanelah na hram pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ngun patetlah na tawng teh, hro e hno patetlah na tawng pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae na panue vaiteh, Cathut panuenae hah na hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni lungangnae a poe teh, a pahni hoi panuenae hoi thaipanueknae hah ouk a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikalannaw hanelah lungangnae katang hah a pâkhueng pouh teh, kalan lah kacetnaw hanelah bahling lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kângingnae lam hah a ring teh, a tamikathoungnaw e lamthung hah a ngue pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelahoi, kângingnae hoi lannae na thaipanuek vaiteh, ngaima tawnhoehnae hoi kahawi e lamthung hai na panue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na lungthin dawk lungangnae a kâen toteh, panuenae teh, na hringnae kanawm sakkung lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Poukpanueknae ni na ngue vaiteh, thaipanueknae ni na ring han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e lamthung dawk hoi na rungngang han. Lawk longkawi lah ka dei e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lannae lamthung ka pahnawt niteh, hmonae lamthung dawn hanelah ka cet e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />thoenae saknae dawk lungkahawi e, tamikathout lanhoehnae dawk a lungkahawi e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lam longkawi ka dawn niteh, a lamthung dawk yuemkamcu hoeh e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kahlong lae napui hoi pasawtpanep lawk ka hno e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A naw nah hui ka cettakhai niteh, a Cathut lawkkam kapahnimnaw koehoi nang hah na rungngang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnie im ni duenae koe lah a hrawi teh, ahnie lam ni tamikadoutnaw koelah a pâtam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahni koe kacetnaw teh ban boihoeh toe. Hringnae lam hah dawn boi awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang teh tamikahawinaw e lamthung na dawn vaiteh, lannae lamthung pou na dawn thai nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tamikalan teh ram dawk kho a sak vaiteh, tami kakuep teh hawvah pou ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei, tamikathout teh talai van hoi takhoe lah awm vaiteh, yuemkamcu hoeh naw hah phawk lah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka capa, kaie kâlawk hah pahnim hanh. Kaie kâpoelawknaw hah na lung dawk pâkuemh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hote ni na hringsawnae hoi roumnae na thap sin han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungmanae hoi lawkkatang ni na cettakhai hanh naseh. Na lahuen dawk awi nateh, na lungthin dawkvah thut haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hottelah Cathut hoi tami hmalah, minhmai kahawi na hmu vaiteh, tawmrasang lah na o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lungthin buem hoi BAWIPA kâuep nateh, nama e thaipanueknae hah kângue hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na lamthung pueng dawk ama na panuek haw, na lamthung pueng dawk na hrawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Namahoima lungkaang lah kâsak hanh. BAWIPA hah taket nateh yon cettakhaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na takthai hanelah damnae lah ao vaiteh, na hru hanelah thasainae lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na tawnta e naw hoi aluepawnaw hoi BAWIPA hah bari haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi na capai dawk a kawi vaiteh, misur katinnae tangkom dawk misur katha hoi a kawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka capa, BAWIPA yuenae hah dudam hanh. Na phep e hai hmuhma hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na pa ni a lungpataw e capa teh ouk a yue e patetlah, BAWIPA ni a lungpataw e naw hah ouk a yue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungmanae kahmawtnaw teh a lung kahawi e tami lah ao awh teh, Thaipanueknae ka tawn e tami hai a lung kahawi e tami lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ngun pungdaw sak e hlak, lungmanae pungdaw sak e hah ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Talungpaling hlak hai aphu ao teh, na ngai e pueng ni hai phat hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aranglae kut dawk hringsawnae ao teh, avoilah e kut dawk hnopai hoi barinae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lamthung teh lamthung kanawm lah ao teh, a lamthung pueng teh roumnae lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kakuennaw hanelah hringnae thingkung lah ao teh, ka hringkhaie pueng teh tami lung kahawi e lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />BAWIPA ni lungangnae lahoi talai hah a kangdue sak teh, thaipanueknae lahoi kalvan a cak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A panuenae lahoi talî a kapek teh, tâmai ni tadamtui a bo sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka capa, lungangnae katang hoi panuethainae hah kuen nateh, na mit hoi kâhlat sak hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hottelah pawiteh, na muitha hanelah hringnae lah awm vaiteh, na lahuen hanelah pahrennae lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hottelah na lamthung dawk karoumcalah na cet vaiteh, na khok na kamthui mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na i navah na taket mahoeh, ihmu katuilah na i han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Taki ka tho e kaluekalapnae hai taket hanh. Hoehpawiteh, tamikathoutnaw ni a kâhmo awh e runae hai taket hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA teh na kânguenae lah awm vaiteh, na khok teh karap dawk hoi a hlout sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sak nahane kâ na kut dawk ao nahlangva, hmu hanelah kakamcunaw hah hnokahawi pasoung laipalah awm hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Poe hane na sin nahlangva, cet ei, bout tho lah a, tangtho torei na poe han, telah na imri koe tet pouh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na imri taranlahoi thoenae sak hanelah kâcai hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang na ka ring e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang dawk patawnae na poe hoeh pawiteh, a khuekhaw awm laipalah tami taran hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tami rep kacoungroenaw e hnopai noe awh hanh. Ahnimae lamthung hai rawi awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a lungthin ka longkawi e teh BAWIPA hanelah panuet a tho teh, a lungthin kalan e teh, ama hoi arulahoi kâponae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e im dawk, BAWIPA thoebonae ao, hatei, tamikalannaw e im teh, yawhawi a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dudam lahoi kaawmnaw hah a dudam teh, ka kârahnoumnaw hah pahrennae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tami lungkaang ni bawilennae râw a coe han. Hatei, tamipathunaw ni a coe awh e râw teh, kayanae doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka canaw, na pa ni na cangkhainae hah thai awh nateh, thaipanueknae hah panue hanelah na hnâpakeng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, cangkhainae kahawi hah na poe dawkvah, kaie kâlawk hah cettakhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Apa e capa lah ka o navah, anu e capa a pahren e tawntoe e capa lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pâtu hai na pâtu teh, na lungthin hoi ka lawknaw hah pâkuem haw. Kaie kâpoelawknaw hah tarawi nateh hring haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungangnae hah tawn nateh, thaipanueknae hah tawn haw. Ka pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e lawknaw hah pahnim laipalah, kamlang takhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cettakhai hanh, na ring nakaima. Lungpataw haw na ngue han kaima.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungangnae teh a lawkpui poung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Talue sak haw, na tawmrasang han. Tapam haw, barinae koe na ceikhai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lû dawk lungmanae na kâmuk sak han, bawilennae bawilakhung hah na kâmuk sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka capa, ka dei e hah thai nateh, dâw haw. Na hringyung a saw sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungangnae lamthung na cangkhai teh, lamkalan dawk na hrawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na cei navah, na khok hanelah kamthuinae awm mahoeh, na yawng navah na tâlaw mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na cangkhainae hah kacaklah kuen nateh, tha laipalah pou kuen haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, na hringnae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e lamthung dawk kâen awh hanh. Tami kahawihoehnaw e lamthung dawn hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Roun nateh, khoeroe dawn hanh, kamlang takhai nateh, cettakhaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hno kathout sak hoeh pawiteh, ip thai awh hoeh niteh, tami buetbuet touh tâlaw sak hoehpawiteh, ihmu tho awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, thoenae vaiyei hah a ca awh teh, rektapnae yamu hah a nei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatei, tamikalannaw e lamthung teh, kanî raeng, kanî tuengtalueng a thunnae kanî ang patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e lamthung teh khohmo patetlah ao teh, tâlawnae akungcing hai panuek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka capa, ka lawk kahawicalah thai haw, ka dei e hah atangcalah pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na mit hoi kâhlat sak hanh, na lungthin dawk pâkuemh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kahmawtnaw hanelah hringnae lah ao teh, a takthai abuemlah hanelah damnae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hno pueng hlak hoi na lungthin hah kahawicalah ring haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, hringnae akungtuen lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Dumyennae pahni hah pahnawt nateh, payonnae pahni hah ahlanae koe takhoe haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na mit hoi hmalah kalan lah khen nateh, na hmalah kalan lah radoung haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na lamthung hah hmaloe rip nateh, na lamthung pueng hah cak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aranglah nakunghai, avoilah nakunghai phen hanh. Thoenae lamthung hah roun haw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka capa, poukpanueknae na tawn nahane hoi, na pahni ni panuenae a pâkuem thai nahanelah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />kaie lungangnae hah thai nateh, kaie thaipanueknae dawk na hnâpakeng haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, napui kathoutnaw e pahni teh, khoitui patetlah a radip, a lawk teh sathaw hlak hai a pâhnan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatei, apoutnae koe lateh, hmue patetlah a kha teh, avoivang kahran e sarai patetlah a hran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A khok ni duenae lamthung a pâtam teh, a khok takan ni sheol hmai a pâtam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoehpawiteh, a hringnae lamthung na pouk hoeh vaiteh, a lamthung a cak hoeh e hah na panuek mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ka canaw, atuvah, ka lawk thai awh haw. Ka dei e lawknaw hah pahnawt awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatei, ahlanae koe kampuen awh nateh, ahnie im takhang hoi hai hnai awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hoehpawiteh, barinae na hmu e hah ayâ alouk koe kampuen payon vaih. Tami nuen kamathoutnaw rahak vah, na hringnae be na hno payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hoehpawiteh, ramlouknaw ni na tawntanae dawk nawm awh vaiteh, na thaw tawk e a pawnaw hah ramlouknaw im vah phat payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Apoutnae koe lah, na takthai a kamsoe toteh, na khui payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangtelamaw, cangkhainae hah koe ka hmuhma teh, yuenae hah ka lungthin hoi koe ka dudam toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kacangkhaikung e lawk hah koe ka tarawi ngaihoeh niteh, na cangkhainae hah koe ka thai ngaihoeh heh ma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tamimaya hoi kamkhuengnaw koe rawknae kâhmo hoeh e dueng doeh hei na ti han na kaima.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nange tuikhu, na tuikhu hoi ka tâcawt e tui roeroe hah na nei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tuiphuek hah ram tangkuem lawng vaiteh tamimaya ceinae lamnaw dawk a lawng han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nama hanelah dueng awm seh, ayâ alouke hoi kâkabawpkhai hane nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na tuikhu teh yawhawi seh, na naw nah e na yu koe na lungkuep lawih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai kaawm e sayuk hoi a meikahawi e sayukhre patetlah, a sannunaw ni na lungkuep sak naseh. A lungpatawnae ni na lungkuep sak naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangtelamaw, ka capa nang ni napui kahawihoehe hah na ngai vaiteh, khuet na tapam han vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami hringnae lamthungnaw teh, BAWIPA ni koung a hmu teh, a lamthung pueng koung a pouk pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama pouknae ni tamikayon teh a man vaiteh, a yonnae tangron hoi pâkhi lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cangkhainae a vout dawkvah, a due vaiteh, puenghoi a pathu dawkvah, a kahma han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka capa, na hui hanelah lawk na kam teh, ayâ alouk hoi na kut na tambei pawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na dei e lawk dawk letlang na kâman toe. Na dei e lawk hoi la lah na o toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatnavah, ka capa, hettelah namahoima na kârungngang han. Bangtelamaw na hui kut dawk na pha toung dawkvah, kârahnoumnae lahoi cet nateh, kâhet lah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ip hanh, ngam takhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moi ka me e koehoi sakhi ni a yawng takhai e patetlah, yawng takhai haw, tangkam dawk hoi kahlout e tava patetlah kamleng takhai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nange tami ka pangak, lungkhi koe cet nateh, a oangnae lahoi lungangnae kamtu haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh, kahrawikung, karipkung, kaukkung, tawn awh hoeh eiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kawmpoi vah rawca a pâtung awh teh, canga tue nah rawca a pâtung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Oe, tami ka pangak, nâtotouh maw na i han. Nâtuek maw na kâhlaw han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ip ei haw pawiteh, dongdeng ka yan ei haw pawiteh, kut kâtapam hoi dongdeng kâhat ei haw pawiteh, na ti lahun nah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mathoenae ni karum kâva e patetlah vaitalahoi na tho sin vaiteh, voutthoupnae ni kutdaw patetlah na tho sin han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami cungkeihoeh e, tami kahawihoehe teh, tamthoe hoi a kâhlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mit a kaluek teh, a khok hoi mitnout a poe teh, a kutdawn hoi a takhi teh a pâtu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lungpouk a longkawi teh, pout laipalah, hawihoehnae dueng a pouk teh, kâyuenae cati doeh ouk a tu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kahmakatanae ni vaitalahoi a tho sin han. Vaitalahoi damthaihoehnae kahmakatanae a kâhmo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hete hno taruk touh heh, BAWIPA ni a hmuhma. Bokheiyah, a panuet e hno sari touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kâoupnae mit, laithoe ka deinae lai, yon ka tawn hoeh e tami theinae kut,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hawihoehnae meng ka pouk e lungthin, kahawihoehe sak nahanelah a hue ka rang e khok,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laithoe ouk ka dei e kapanuekkhaikung kaphawk hoi, hmaunawngha rahak kâpohoehnae cati ka patuekungnaw doeh .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka capa, na pa e kâpoelawk hah tarawi nateh, na manu e kâlawk hah cettakhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungthung pâkuem nateh, na lahuen dawk awi haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Alouklah na cei toteh, hote kâlawk ni na hrawi han, na i navah na ring vaiteh, na kâhlaw toteh, na pato han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangtelah tetpawiteh, kâpoe e teh, hmaiim lah ao teh, kâlawk teh angnae lah ao. Cingthuilasak e teh hringnae lamthung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Napui kathout hoi pasawtpanepnae koehoi na hlout sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na lungthin hoi a meihawinae nôe hanh lah a, a mit padainae ni na man hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kâyawt e napui kecu dawk, tongpatang heh vaiyei tangen lah a coung teh, ayâ yu ka yonkhai e ni, ka sungren e a hringnae hah a raphoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tami ni a kho e angki kang laipalah hmaisaan a yawm thai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tami ni a khok kang laipalah, hmaisaan van a cei thai han na maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hot patetvanlah, a imri yu ka ipkhai e tami hai hot patetlah doeh ao. Ayâ yu ka ipkhai e tami teh, yonnae hoi hlout hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A vonhlam dawk tami ni parawt pawiteh, hote tamru teh tami ni pacekpahlek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hmu lah awm pawiteh, let sari touh hoi a patho roeroe hanelah ao. A im dawk kaawm e hno pueng a rawng hanelah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ayâ yu hoi ka uicuk e tami pueng teh, panuenae ka tawn hoeh e tami doeh. Ama hringnae ka raphoekung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hmâtan cat vaiteh, min mathoe a kâhmo han. A kayanae teh roum thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, dipmanae ni vanaw puenghoi a lung ouk a khuek sak. Moipathungnae hnin navah hlout thai mahoeh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Rawng e hno nâyittouh hai banglah noutna mahoeh. Hno moikapap ka poe nakunghai a lung roum sak thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka capa, ka lawk hah hringkhai nateh, kaie kâpoelawknaw hah na thung vah pâkuem haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kaie kâpoelawk hah, pâkuem nateh, hringkhai haw. Hahoi, Kaie kâpoelawknaw hah na mitmu patetlah ring haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kutdawnnaw dawk pâkhit nateh, na lungthin dawkvah thut haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungangnae koevah, ka tawncanu lah na o tet nateh, thaipanueknae hah na tawncanu patetlah pouk haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Het niyah napui kahawihoehnaw koehoi na hlout sak vaiteh, lawk radip lawk pâhnan naw koehoi na ring han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kama im e hlalangaw dawk hoi ka khet boteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kamawngrame thung dawk, nawsai buet touh hah tanglanaw rahak vah ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hote napui aonae lamtakin koe a pha awh toteh, ahni im lah ceinae lamtalawi hah a dawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangmin karumsaning a pha toteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hawvah, hak kamthoup niteh, ka kâyawt e napui ni a kâhmo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote napui teh a im vah duem kaawm thai hoeh e, a lungkatang e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lamthung hoi lam takin koe ao teh tamipueng hah ouk a pawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A takawi teh, tang a paco Lungpuennae awm laipalah, hettelah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Roum thueng hane ka tawn. Sahnin ka lawkkam ka kuep sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatdawkvah nang dawn hanelah ka tho. Na tawng teh na kâhmo toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ikhun dawk a meikahawi poung e hni Izip lukkarei a em kaawm e sut ka phai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ikhun teh, murah hoi aloe, nakzik hmuitui hoi ka pathoup toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tho haw, khodai totouh, lungpatawnae lahoi phaibongcito roi sei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka vâ teh im vah awm hoeh. Tangkabom a sin teh, kho hlanae koe kahlawng yo a cei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thapa a kamhluem to doeh tho ti toe telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lawkdeithoumnae ni a tâ teh, lawk pâhnan hoi a tacuek thai
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Maitotan ni moi theinae koe a pâtam e patetlah thoseh, sayuk ni a lungthin pala ni a cusin hoehnahlan karap coungroe e patetlah thoseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tava ni a due nahanelah patung e tangkam a panue hoeh teh, karanglah a kâen e patetlah thoseh, thoundoun teh hote napui hnuk tang a kâbang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ka capanaw, ka lawk heh tarawi awh nateh, ka dei e lawk hah kahawicalah pouk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na lungthin hah hote napui koelah, kamlang sak hanh, a dawn e lam dawk dawn hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tami moikapap hmâ a paca teh, athakaawme tami moikapap a kamlei sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahnie im teh phuen koe ceinae lamkalen lah ao teh, duenae tangkom thung na ka hrawi e lah ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungangnae ni a kaw teh, thaipanueknae ni a lawk a cai sak nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Monsom vah tahungnae a sak teh, lam teng hoi lamtalawi koe ouk a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khopui kâennae longkha koehoi, kâennae thonaw koevah, kacaipounglah a oung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Oe, taminaw, nangmouh hah na kaw awh. Ka lawk hah taminaw hane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oe kamawngrame, lungangnae hah thaipanuek awh. Nangmouh tamipathunaw thaipanueknae lungthin tawn awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thai awh haw, kahawi poung e hah ka dei vaiteh, ka pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e teh, kalan e han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka pahni ni lawkkatang a dei han, thoenae teh ka pahni hanelah panuet a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka pahni hoi ka dei e lawk pueng teh, lannae doeh. Kâcawngmet e hoi ka longkawi e awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kathaipanueknaw hanelah a kamceng teh, panuenae katawnnaw hanelah a lan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tangka hlak kaie cangkhainae hah dâw awh. Sui kahawi hlak panuenae heh kârawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, lungangnae teh Rubies talung hlak ahawihnawn. Ngai kawi e hno pueng hoi hote hno hah bangnue thai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai, lungangnae teh lungang laihoi ka o. Panuinae hoi poukthainae hai ka tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />BAWIPA taki e teh yon hmuhma e doeh. Kâoupnae hoi kaisuenae, yonnae lamthung hoi lawk kalan deihoehnae pahninaw heh ka hmuhma.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kâpankhainae hoi lungangnae katang hateh, kaie naw doeh. Thaipanueknae lah ka o teh thaonae ka tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kai pawlawk hoi siangpahrangnaw ni a uk awh teh, ukkungnaw ni kalan lah laidei ouk a tâtueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kai pawlawk hoi ukkungnaw hoi tami kalennaw hoi bari kaawmnaw hoi talai van e lawkcengkung pueng ni uknae kâ a tawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kai lungpataw e teh, kai ni ka lungpataw van, atangcalah na katawngnaw ni na hmu awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tawntanae hoi barinae teh kai koe kaawm e naw doeh. Kangning e tawntanae hoi lannae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kaie a paw teh sui hlak hai ahawihnawn. Bokheiyah, sui kathoung hlak hai ahawihnawn. Hahoi ka hmu e hnopai teh, kahawi e ngun hlak hai ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lannae hoi kângingnae lamthung lungui vah ka cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hottelah, kai lungpataw naw koe hnopai tabu dawk, hno akawi nahanlah hnopai ka coe sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />BAWIPA ni a kamtawng lahun nahoi, ayan e thaw a tawk hoehnahlan vah, yo na tawn toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Talai ao hoehnahlan hoi a kamtawng hoehnahlan vah, a yungyoe caksak lah ka o toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kadungpoung e talî ao hoehnahlan hoi, tuinaw pueng a tâco hoehnahlan vah, yo ka tâco toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Talai hoi vaiphu ao hoehnahlan, talai hoi ramnaw a sak hoehnahlan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Montamnaw ao hoehnahlan vah, yo ka tâco toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kalvannaw a rakueng lahun navah, yo ka o toe. Kadungpoung e talî dawk e kâheinae a sak navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kalvan e tâmai a yam sak navah, kadungpoung e talî, ka lawng e palang, tha a poe navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tui ni a kâpoelawk a ek hoeh nahanlah, talîpui hanelah a langri a khuen pouh navah, talai du a ung navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kai teh kawk e capa patetlah ama koe ka o teh, pout laipalah ama lung kahawi sakkung lah ka o. A hmalah ka konawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />O nahanelah a sak e talai ni, ka konawm sak, taminaw ni ka ko hoe a nawm sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ka canaw, atu ka lawk thai awh haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka lamthung kadawnnaw teh tami yaw kahawi e lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cangkhainae heh thai awh nateh, lungang awh haw, banglah noutna laipalah awm hanh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hnin tangkuem kaie longkha koehoi na ring teh, takhang koehoi na ngaihawi. Ka lawk ka ngâi e teh, tami yaw kahawi e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kai na kahmawt e pueng teh hringnae ka hmawt e lah ao. BAWIPA ni ngaikhainae hai ouk a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hatei, kai dawk yonnae kasaknaw ni amae hringnae a raphoe teh, na ka maithoe e pueng teh duenae ka lungpataw naw doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungangnae ni a im a sak teh khom sari touh a ung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moi a thei teh misurtui a phunphun hoi a kalawt teh ca hanelah caboi van a pâtoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A san tanglanaw a patoun teh, khopui hmuenrasang koehoi a oung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamawngrame pueng hi lavah kamlang awh naseh. Oe, thaipanueknae kavoutnaw hai tho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaie vaiyei hah cat awh. Aphunphun kalawt e misurtui hah net awh a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kamawngrame hah cettakhai awh nateh, hring awh. Hahoi thaipanueknae lamthung hah dawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ayâ ka dudam e tami hah ka yue e teh, yeirai a po han. Tamikathout ka yue e teh pacekpahleknae a kâhmo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ayâ ka dudam e tami hah na yue pawiteh, na hmuhma han. Tamilungkaang e na yue pawiteh, ahni ni na lungpataw han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamilungkaang hah yue haw, a lung hoe a ang han. Tamikalan hah pâtu haw thoumthainae a kâthap han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae teh lungang kamtawngnae a kung doeh. Kathounge Cathut panue e teh thaipanueknae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na hnin hah kai ni ka pap sak vaiteh, na hringyung kum na thap pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na lungang pawiteh, na lungangnae phu na hmu han. Na dudam pawiteh, nama ni na khang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Napui pathu teh a hramki teh, kamawngrame lah ao dawkvah, banghai panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A im takhang koe a tahung teh, khopui hmuen rasang tahungnae koe a tahung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lam dawk amamae lamthung dawk kacetnaw hah a kaw teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />kamawngrame pueng hivah tho awh, lungangnae ka tawn hoeh naw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />paru e tui teh a radip, arulahoi ca e vaiyei teh hoe a tui telah ouk a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatei, hawvah tamikadoutnaw ao teh, amae imyinnaw teh adungnae koe sheol dawk ao awh tie hah hote tongpa ni panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon e cingthuilawk: Capa a lungkaang e ni teh, a na pa a lunghawi sak. Hatei, capa ka pathu e teh, a manu lung ka mathout sakkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thoenae lahoi pâkhueng e hnopai teh, hawinae awmhoeh. Hatei, lannae ni teh duenae koehoi a rungngang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />BAWIPA ni tamikalannaw a pasai teh, tamikathoutnaw ngainae hah a tâkhawng pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pangaknae ni mathoenae a tâco sak teh, hratbatnae ni tawntanae a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kawmpoi tueng navah rawca ka pâkhueng e teh, a lungkaang e capa doeh. Canga lahun nah ka ip e capa teh yeirai ka po sakkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamikalan lû dawk yawhawinae ao teh, tamikathoutnaw e pahni teh rektapnae hoi akawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikalannaw pahnimhoehnae heh yawhawinae lah ao han. Hatei, tamikathoutnaw e min teh a pawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami lungkaang ni teh kâpoelawknaw a lungthin hoi a dâw, hatei, a lawk kapap e tamipathu teh a rawp han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lannae lahoi ka cet e tami teh karoumcalah a cei, hatei lam longkawi ka dawn e teh panue lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mit cumasipnae ni lungmathoenae a tâco sak, lawk kapap e tamipathu teh a rawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamikalan e pahni teh hringnae tuiphuek doeh. Hatei, tami kahawihoehnaw e pahni teh moikainae ni a ramuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hmuhmanae ni kâpohoehnae a tâco sak. Hatei, lungpatawnae niteh, yonnae pueng a ramuk pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thaipanueknae ka tawn e pahni dawk lungangnae hah hmu e lah a o, hatei, hemnae bongpai teh thaipanueknae ka tawn hoeh e a hnukthun vah a bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami a lungkaangnaw niteh, thoumthainae heh a pâkhueng awh, hatei, tamipathu e pahni niteh, rawknae hah a hnai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami katawntanaw hanelah teh, a tawntanae hah ka cak e khopui lah ao teh, tamimathoenaw rawknae teh, a mathoenae doeh .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamikalan thaw tawknae ni hringnae a tâcokhai teh, tamikathoutnaw e tawkphu teh, thoe khangnae hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cangkhainae ka tarawi e teh, hringnae lamthung dawk ao. Hatei, yuenae ka ek e teh, lamthung ka phen e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmuhmanae hah laithoe deinae pahni hoi ka ramuk e tami, ayâ min mathoe nahanelah ka dei e tami teh tamipathu doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lawk pap pawiteh, payon e hai a pap. Hatei, a pahni ka cakuep e tami teh tami a lungkaang e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamikalan e lai teh, kahawi e ngun patetlah ao teh, tamikathout e lungthin teh aphu awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamikalan e pahni ni tami moikapap a kawk. Hatei, tamipathu teh lungangnae a vout dawkvah a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />BAWIPA yawhawinae ni tami a tawnta sak teh, lungmathoenae thokhai boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamipathu hanelah teh, yonnae sak e heh a nawmnae lah a coung. Hatei, thaipanueknae ka tawn e niteh, lungangnae a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tamikathout teh a taki e patetlah a lathueng a pha vaiteh, tamikalan teh a ngai e hah poe lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bongparui a kâkaven toteh, tamikathoutnaw teh a kahma han. Hatei, tamikalan ni teh a yungyoe adu hungnae a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tami pangak patoun e teh, misurtui kathut e ni hah a kip sak e hoi, hmaikhu ni mit a ut e patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae ni hringyung a saw sak, hatei, tamikathout e hringyung teh duem sak lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamikalan ni ngaihawi e teh lunghawinae lah ao, hatei, tamikathout e ngaihawinae teh a kahma han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tamikalan hanelah BAWIPA e lamthung teh thaonae doeh. Hatei, thoenae ka sak e teh, rawkkahmanae koe a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tamikalan teh hmuen dawk hoi nâtuek hai puen lah awm mahoeh. Hatei, tamikathoutnaw ni talai heh onae lah hno awh mahoeh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tamikalan e pahni ni lungangnae a tâcokhai, hatei ka longkawi e lai teh, tâtueng pouh lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tamikalan e pahni ni ngai kawi e hno hah a panue, hatei tamikathout e pahni niteh, kâtarannae lawk doeh ouk a dei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kânging hoeh e yawcu teh BAWIPA hanelah panuet a tho teh, kânging e bangnuenae teh a ngai e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kâoup navah yeiraiponae ao teh, kârahnoum navah lungangnae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamikalan teh yuemkamcunae ni a hrawi han, hatei, yuemkamcu hoeh e khopouknae niteh amamouh a raphoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungkhueknae tueng navah hnopai teh cungkeihoeh, hatei lannae ni teh duenae koehoi a rungngang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lannae ni teh toun kaawm hoeh e naw hah lam kalan a pâtue han, hatei, tamikathoutnaw teh thoenae dawk letlang a rawp awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamikalannaw teh lannae ni a rungngang awh han, hatei, yuemkamcu hoeh e naw teh amamae ngainae dawk a kâman awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw a due awh toteh a ngaihawi awh e puenghai a kahma vaiteh, tamikalanhoehnaw e ngaihawinae puenghai a kahma han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamikalan teh runae thung hoi a hlout vaiteh, hote runae teh tamikathoutnaw ni a pang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cathut ka taket hoeh e niteh, a pahni hoi a imri ouk a raphoe, hatei, tamikalan teh thoumthainae lahoi rungngang lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamikalan ni hawinae a coe navah khobuem a konawm awh, hatei, tamikathout a due toteh a lunghawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamikalan ni yawhawi a coe navah khopui hai tawmrasang lah a o, hatei, tamikathoutnaw e pahni ni teh ouk a raphoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungangnae ka vout e tami ni teh a imri hah ouk a dudam, hatei, thaipanueknae ka tawn e teh duem ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Yuengyoe ka pai ni teh lawk kapap e tami ni hrolawk hah ouk a pâpho, hatei, yuemkamcu e ni teh ouk a hro.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pouknae kahawi poenae a ohoehnae koe khocanaw ouk a kahma teh, pouknae kahawi poenae apapnae koe teh khocanaw roumnae a coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Panue hoeh e tami panuesaknae teh a khang han, hatei, lawkpanuesaknae dawk kut tambeinae ka ngai hoeh e teh a hlout han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pahrennae ka tawn e napui ni barinae a coe, hatei, a thakasai e tongpa ni teh tawntanae a coe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pahrennae ka tawn e tami ni a hringnae han lah hnokahawi a sak, hatei, tamikathout teh a takthai hanelah runae kapoekung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tamikathout ni dumnae phu ouk a hmu awh, hatei, lannae cati katukkungnaw ni tawkphu katang teh a coe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lannae ni hringnae lamthung dawk tami a hrawi e patetlah, thoenae ka sak e ni ouk a duekhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungthin ka longkawi e teh BAWIPA hanelah panuet a tho, hatei, tamikalan kakuepcingnaw e hringnae teh amamouh letlang lunghawinae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungkânging lah ao awh nakunghai, tamikathout teh rek laipalah awm mahoeh. Hatei, tamikalannaw e canaw teh hloutsak lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A meihawi eiteh pouknae ka tawn hoeh e napui teh, vok hnawng dawk suikuthrawt bang pouh e patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamikalan ni ngainae teh hawinae dueng doeh, hatei, tamikathout ni a ring e teh lungkhueknae dueng doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thouk ka poe e teh, thouk a tawnta, hatei moikapap a pâkhueng eiteh, ka mathoe e tami hai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hring ka pasoung e teh tawnta sak lah ao han. Ayâ tui ka awi e teh ama hai tui awi lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cakang ka haw e tami teh ayâ ni thoe a bo han. hatei, kayawtkung koe teh yawhawinae ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hawinae ka tawng katang e ni barinae a coe han. hatei, thoenae ka tawng koe teh runae a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hnopai kâuep e teh a rawp han, hatei tamikalan teh phokung patetlah dikhring han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ma e imthung runae ka poe e ni a coe e râw teh kahlî lah ao vaiteh, tamipathu teh a lungkaangnaw koe san lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tamikalannaw e a paw teh hringnae thing paw lah ao teh, muitha ka man e teh tami a lungkaang e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tamikalan patenghai talai van reknae khang pawiteh, cathutlaipa e hoi tamikayon teh banghloimaw hoe a khang han vai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cangkhainae ka ngai e teh panuenae hah a ngai toe, hatei yuenae ka hmuhma e teh tamipathu doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami kahawi ni teh BAWIPA ni ngaikhai e hah ouk a hmu, hatei hawihoehnae sak hanelah kakâcainaw teh yonpen lah ao awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hawihoehnae ni tami caksak boi hoeh, hatei tamikalan e adu teh tahruet thai lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Napui kahawi teh a vâ hanelah bawilukhung lah ao, hatei yeirai ka po sak e napui teh a vâ e hru ka hmawnsakkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamikalan pouknae teh a lan, hatei tamikathoutnaw e pouknae teh dumyennae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e lawk teh, thei hanelah pawm awh sei, tie hah doeh. Hatei tamikalan e pahni ni teh a rungngang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikathout teh tâkhawng lah ao teh awm hoeh toe, hatei tamikalan e imthung teh a cak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami a lung a ang awh e patetlah rip oup lah ao, hatei a lungthin ka longkawi e teh dudam lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amahoima a kâoup teh ca hane kaawm hoeh e tami hlak teh, apinihai oup laipalah mae thaw duem ka tawk e bet ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamikalan ni teh amae saringnaw hah a pasai, hatei tamikathout teh a pahrennae dawk patenghai a moikai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amae laikawk ka thawn e ni kaboumlah a ca han, hatei ayawmyin lah kho ka sak e tami teh thaipanueknae ka tawn hoeh e tami doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamikathout ni tamikathoutnaw e tangkhek hah a doun awh, hatei tamikalannaw e kung ni teh apaw a paw sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamikathout teh amae eknae dawk ouk a kâman, hatei tamikalan teh runae thung hoi ouk a hlout.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami ni amae pahnipaw hah kaboumlah a ca han, amae a kut hoi a tawk e a paw hai poe lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tamipathu ni amae lamthung hah kalan poung e lah a pouk, hatei pouknae poe e ka ngâi e tami teh a lungkaang e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamipathu e lungkhueknae teh tang a kamnue, hatei kahawicalah kho ka pouk e ni teh kayanae hah ouk a ramuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lawkkatang ka dei e ni lannae a kamnue sak, hatei kapanuekkhaikung kaphawk niteh kadumyennaw hah a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tahloi hoi thut e patetlah lawk ka dei e ao awh, hatei tami lungkaangnaw e lawk ni teh a dam sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lawkkatang pahni teh a yungyoe caksak lah ao han, hatei laithoe deinae lai teh dongdengca hanelah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hawihoehnae pouknae lungthin dawk dumyennae ao, hatei roumnae kadeikungnaw ni konawmnae a tawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamikalan koe thoenae phat mahoeh, hatei tamikathout teh thoenae hoi a kawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Laithoe pahni teh BAWIPA ni a hmuhma e doeh, hatei kalan lah ka tawk e teh lunghawikhai e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kho ka pouk thai e tami ni teh a panue e patenghai a hro rah, hatei tamipathu e lungthin ni teh pathunae dueng doeh a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami ka hratbat e kut ni a uk han, hatei ka pangak e teh lawkceng vaiteh thama lahoi tawk sak lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khopouk papnae ni lungmathoenae a tâco sak, hatei lawkkahawi ni tami konawm sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tamikalan ni teh a imri hah lamthung a patue, tamikathout ni teh lam a phen sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tami ka pangak niteh, kahrawng a cei ei, moi thokhai e boehai cat mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lannae lamthung dawk hringnae ao teh, hote lamthung dawk teh duenae awm hoe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Capa lungkaang ni teh na pa e cangkhainae hah alawkpui lah a ta, hatei kadudamnaw ni teh cangkhainae hah ngai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami ni amae pahnipaw hah kahawicalah a ca han, hatei yuemkamcu hoeh e tami teh rektapnae hoi a kâkawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pahni ka ring e ni teh a hringnae hah a ring toe, hatei ka kaw lah a kâko ka ang e teh rawknae koe a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami pangaknaw ni teh a ngai poung awh ei banghai tawn awh hoeh, hatei tami kahratbat e teh tawnta sak lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamikalan ni teh laithoe dei e a hmuhma, hatei tamikathout teh panuet ka tho e hoi kayanae kaphawtkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toun han kaawm hoeh e lamthung ni lannae a ring, hatei thoenae ni tamikayon a tâkhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami ka tawnta lah a kâpouk ei banghai ka tawn hoeh e tami ao, hatei kamathoe poung lah a kâpouk ei ka tawnta poung e ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tami ka tawnta e ni kâratang nahane hnopai a tawn, hatei mathoe ni yuenae kâhmo boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamikalannaw e angnae teh kahawi poung e angnae doeh, hatei tamikathoutnaw e hmaiim teh a due han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kâoupnae dawk doeh kâyuenae a tâco, hatei pouknae kahawi poe e tarawinae teh lungangnae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamsoumhoehe lah hnopai la e teh tang a kahma han, hatei panki laihoi hmu e hnopai teh a pung han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ring e hno tang hmu hoeh e ni lung a pataw sak, hatei ngaikuepnae teh hringnae thingkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lawk banglahai ka noutna hoeh e teh rawk sak lah ao han, hatei kâpoelawk e ka bari e teh tawkphu poe lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami lungkaangnaw e kâpoelawk e teh hringnae tuiphuek lah ao teh, duenae karap rounnae lamthung lahai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thaipanueknae ni minhmai kahawi a poe, hatei yuemkamcu hoeh naw e lamthung teh a ru poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kho kapoukthai e pueng ni panuenae hoi a kâroe awh, hatei tamipathu ni teh a pathunae a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Patoune kathout teh runae dawk a rawp, hatei yuemkamcu e laicei ni teh damnae a thokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tounnae banglahai ka ngaihoeh e tami koe voutnae hoi yeiraiponae a pha han, hatei tounnae alawkpui lah ka tat e teh bari lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngaikuepnae teh a radip, hatei payonnae rounnae hateh tamikathoutnaw ni a hmuhma awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamilungkaangnaw hoi kamyawng e teh a lung a ang han, hatei, tamikathoutnaw hoi kamyawng e teh a rawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamikayon teh thoenae ni a pâlei, hatei tamikalan teh hawinae a pang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamikahawi ni teh a ca catounnaw hanelah râw a parâw pouh, hatei tamikayonnaw e hnopai teh tamikalannaw hanelah pâkhueng lah ouk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamimathoe ni laikawk thawnnae lahoi rawca moi ao, hatei thoenae dawk doeh rawknae koe ouk pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bongpai ka hno ngai hoeh e teh a capa ka hmuhma e lah ao, hatei a capa lung ka pataw e ni teh a nawca hoi ouk a yue toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tamikalan teh a von a paha, hatei tamikathout teh a vonhlam han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lungkaang e napui ni teh a im hah a sak, hatei ka pathu e ni teh amae kut hoi ouk a raphoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kalanlah ka hring e ni BAWIPA a bari, hatei a hringnae ka longkawi e ni teh a dumdam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamipathu e pahni dawk kaisuenae bongpai ao, hatei tamilungkaang e pahni ni teh kânguenae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maitotan ohoehnae koe maito im a thoung, hatei moikapap pungnae teh maitotha dawk doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Yuemkamcu e ka panuekkhaikung teh laithoe dei hoeh, hatei kapanuekkhaikung kaphawk ni doeh laithoe ouk a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka dudam e tami ni teh lungangnae ka tawng nakunghai hmawt mahoeh, hatei kathaipanueknaw hanelah teh panuenae heh ayawica.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A pahni panuenae na hmu hoeh toteh, tamipathu teh cettakhai yawkaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ma e coungnae panue e heh poukthainae ka tawn e lungangnae doeh, hatei tamipathunaw e pathunae teh dumnae doeh .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamipathu ni teh yonnae a panuikhai, hatei tamikalannaw koe ngaikhainae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungthin patawnae heh lungthin ni doeh a panue, ayânaw ni teh lunghawinae hai hmawngkhai katang hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamikathout imthung teh ka rawk han doeh, hatei tamikalan e rim teh a kamhlawng han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami pouknae lahoi teh lam kalan lah a kamcu eiteh, apoutnae koe lah duenae koe ka phat e lam hai ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Panui lahun nahai lung a mathoe teh, panuinae a poutnae heh lungmathoenae lah a coung thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungthin hoi hnuklah ka ban e teh, ama ngainae hoi a kawi han, hatei tamikahawi teh hot patet e lathueng vah ao dawkvah a lunghawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamawngrame ni dei e pueng a yuem awh, hatei kâhruetcuet e tami ni teh a cei nahane lamthung kahawicalah a pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamilungkaang ni teh a taki dawkvah yonnae hah a roun, hatei tamipathu ni teh amahoima a kâyuem teh a taran a hawi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami lungkaduem teh pathu laihoi a kâroe, hatei tamikathout e noenae teh hmuhmanae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kamawngrame e coe e teh pathunae doeh, hatei kho ka pouk e teh panuenae kâmuksak lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamikahawi teh tamikahawi hmalah a tabut vaiteh, tamikathout teh tamikalan e takhang koe a tabut han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamikathout teh a imri ni hai a hmuhma, hatei tami ka tawnta ni hui moi a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A imri ka dudam e teh tamikayon doeh, hatei tamimathoe ka pahren e teh a lungkahawi e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hnokathout ka pouk e teh lam a phen toung nahoehmaw, hatei lungmanae hoi lawkkatang teh hawinae kapouknaw hane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tawknae pueng dawk meknae ao teh, pahni hoi dei rumram e teh voutnae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tamilungkaangnaw e bawilukhung teh tawntanae doeh, hatei tamipathu pathunae hateh a pathunae doeh .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kapanuekkhaikung katang ni teh hringnae a rungngang, hatei kapanuekkhaikung kaphawk ni teh laithoe ouk a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae dawkvah a taranhawi laihoi a tha ao teh, a canaw ni kânguenae a pang awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae teh hringnae tuiphuek lah ao teh, duenae karap dawk hoi kamlang sakkung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamimaya koe siangpahrang barinae ao teh, tami younca koe e ukkung teh rawkphainae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A lung kasawe ni thaipanueknae a tawn, hatei tami lungkaduem e teh pathu tawmrasangnae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lungthin damnae teh tak hanelah hringnae lah ao teh utsinnae teh hru ka rawk sakkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tamimathoe repcoungroe e teh ama kasakkung dudam e lah ao, hatei kasakkung ka bari e ni tami kavoutthoupnaw pahrennae a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tamikathout teh a thoenae ni letlang a pâlei teh, tamikalan teh a duenae koe kânguenae a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thaipanueknae katawnnaw lungthin dawk lungangnae ao, hatei tamipathu e lungthung kaawm e teh kamnue sak lah ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lannae ni miphun a tawmrasang, hatei yonnae teh tami pueng hanelah min mathoenae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tamilungkaang okhai e teh siangpahrang ni a ngai pouh, hatei yeirai ka po sakkung koe a lung ouk a khuek
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lawkkanem ni lungkhueknae a roum sak, hatei lawkkahram ni lungkhueknae a pâhlaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamilungkaang e lai ni teh, panuenae hah kalan lah ouk a hno, hatei tamipathu ni teh pathunae hah a pahni dawk hoi ouk a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />BAWIPA e mit teh hmuen tangkuem a kâhlai teh hnokahawi hoi hnokathout hah ouk a khet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A tak ka dam e lai teh hringnae thingkung doeh, hatei lawkkahram ni teh lung a mathoe sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamipathu ni a na pa e cangkhainae hah banglah ngâi hoeh, hatei yuenae ka tarawi e tami teh kho ka pouk thai e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamikalan im vah hnopai moikapap ao teh, tamikathout ni a hmu e teh rucatnae hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamilungkaang e pahni ni teh panuenae a pung sak, hatei tamipathu e lungthin ni teh hottelah sak boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamikathout ni thueng e teh BAWIPA hanelah panuet a tho, hatei tamikalan ni ratoum e teh a lunghawinae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamikathout hringnuen teh BAWIPA hanelah panuet a tho, hatei lannae katarawinaw hah teh a lung a pataw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lam kalan kaphennaw teh puenghoi yue lah ao teh, yuenae kahmuhmanaw teh a due han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sheol hoi rawkphainae teh BAWIPA hmalah a kamnue, tami canaw e lungthin teh hoe a kamnue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka dudam e tami teh yuenae ngai hoeh, tamilungkaang koehai cet ngai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungthin nawmnae ni minhmai a pan sak teh, lungreithainae teh lungreknae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thaipanueknae lungthin ka tawn e ni panuenae ouk a tawng, hatei tamipathu ni teh pathunae lawk hoi ouk a kâkawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Runae kâhmo e tami hanelah teh hnin pueng kathout seng doeh, hatei lungthin kanawm e ni teh pawi pou tonae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />BAWIPA taki laihoi younca tawn e teh baruengbaraw o laihoi moikapap tawn e hlak a hawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungpatawnae lahoi ankahring hoi vai touh ca e teh, kâhmuhmanae koe maito buem pui ca e hlak ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami lungkathout ni kâyuenae a tâcokhai, hatei ka panguep thai e ni teh a roum sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kapangaknaw e lamthung teh pâkhing hoi khak a cak, hatei tamikalannaw e lamthung teh a ngaca.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Capa a lungkaang ni teh a na pa a konawm sak, ka pathu e ni teh a manu a dumdam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungangnae ka tawn hoeh e naw niteh pathunae heh a lunghawinae lah a o, hatei thaipanueknae katawnnaw teh kalancalah ouk a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kâpankhainae awm hoeh pawiteh noenae hai kangcoung thai hoeh, hatei kâpankhaikung pap pawiteh noenae a kangcoung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pahni hoi dei e lawk ni lunghawinae a tâco sak, a tue a pha torei dei e lawk teh ahawi poung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tamilungkaangnaw e hringnae lamthung teh kahlun lah a luen, hothateh rahim lae sheol lam dawk hoi a kamlang thainae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />BAWIPA ni tami kâoupnaw e im hah a raphoe pouh han, hatei lahmainu imhmuen teh a caksak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e pouknae teh BAWIPA hanelah panuet a tho, hatei a lung kathoungnaw lawk teh thai a nawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka hounloun e ni ama imthung totouh runae a poe, hatei tadawnghno ka hmuhma e teh a hring han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamikalan lungthin ni teh pato nahane hmaloe a kamtu, hatei tamikathout e pahni ni teh hnokathout ouk a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />BAWIPA teh tamikathout koehoi ahla, hatei tamikalan e ratoumnae teh ouk a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lunghawinae minhmai ni lungthin a nawm sak teh, kamthang kahawi teh hru hanelah hawinae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hring tounnae ka tarawi e tami teh tamilungkaangnaw koe pouh ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cangkhainae banglah ka pouk hoeh e tami teh amae hringnae banglah ka pouk hoeh e tami doeh, hatei yuenae alawkpui lah ka pouk e ni thaipanueknae a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae teh lungangnae cangkhainae lah o teh, barinae ao hoehnahlan kârahnoumnae hmaloe ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungthin hoi pouknae teh tami e doeh, hatei laihoi bout deinae teh BAWIPA koehoi e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami hmunae pueng heh ama ni hmunae lahoi teh a thoung, hatei BAWIPA ni muitha hah yawcu dawk a khing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thaw teh BAWIPA dawk poe haw na pouknae caksak lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />BAWIPA ni bangpueng hai ama hanelah a sak. Tamikathoutnaw haiyah thoenae kâhmo hnin hanelah sak e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lungthin hoi kâoup e tami teh BAWIPA han lah panuet a tho, a lung kânging awh nakunghai, rek lah ao mingming han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungmanae hoi yonthanae lawkkatang teh BAWIPA takinae lahoi tami ni yonnae ouk a ceitakhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami e hringnuen ni BAWIPA a lungyouk torei teh, a taran hoi patenghai a kâpo sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kamsoumhoehe lahoi moikapap tawn e hlak teh, lannae lahoi yitca tawn e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami e lungthin ni amae lamthung ouk a pouk, hatei BAWIPA ni teh a khoktakan hah ouk a hrawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siangpahrang pahni dawk Cathut lawk pâpho hane ao, lawkcengnae koe a pahni a payon sak hanelah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kânging e yawcu hoi khinglung teh BAWIPA e doeh, congko dawk e khinglung puenghai a kut thawtawknae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thoenae lahoi sak e heh siangpahrang hanelah teh panuet a tho, bangkongtetpawiteh, bawitungkhung teh lannae lahoi caksak lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lannae pahni teh siangpahrang hanelah konawmnae lah ao teh, lawkkatang kadeinaw hah a lungpataw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siangpahrang lungkhueknae teh duenae patounenaw patetlah ao, hatei tamilungkaang ni teh a roum sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Siangpahrang mithmaiang dawk hringnae ao, a ngaikhainae teh a hnukteng e kho tâmai patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sui hlak hai lungangnae tawn e heh banghloimaw ahawi, hahoi ngun hlak hai thaipanueknae heh kârawi hanelah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamikalannaw e lamthung teh yonnae ceitakhai e hah doeh, a lamthung ka ring e ni a hringnae a ring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rawk hoehnahlan kâoupnae ao teh, rawp hoehnahlan lunglennae muitha ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kâoupnae lahoi lawphno kârei hlak teh, kârahnoumnae hoi ka rahnoumcalah o e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kâhruetcuetcalah hoi lawk ka tarawi e ni hnokahawi a hmu vaiteh, BAWIPA ka kâuep e teh tami yawkahawi e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungthin hoi a lungkaang e teh kho ka pouk e doeh tie lah ao vaiteh, lawkradip ni thoumthainae a pung sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thaipanueknae heh ka tawn hanelah teh hringnae tuiphuek lah ao teh, tamipathunaw e cangkhainae teh pathunae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamilungkaang ni teh a pahni hah a cangkhai teh, a pahni hoi thoumthainae hah ouk a kâthap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lawkkahawi teh khoipha patetlah ao, hring nahanelah a radip teh hru hanelah damnae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami pouknae lateh lamkalan lah a kamcu ei, apoutnae koe teh duenae lamthung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thaw ka tawk e teh ama hanelah doeh a tawk, bangkongtetpawiteh a vonhlamnae pahni ni a patoun e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cathut ka taket hoeh e ni thoenae tangkom a tai teh, a pahni teh hmaisaan patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lungthin longkawi ni kâyuenae cati a kahei teh, tamcueklawk ka dei e ni hai huiko a kapek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kaisue e ni a imri a pasawtpanep teh, hawihoehnae lamthung dawk ouk a hrawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A mitmasip teh kahawihoehe dueng doeh a pouk, a pahni a kâroe sak teh thoenae dueng doeh a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lannae lamthung dawk hmu e lah awm pawiteh, sampo teh bawilennae bawilakhung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Athakaawme tami hlak a lungkasaw e tami ahawihnawn, a hringnae kâcakuep thai e kaukkung teh khopui ka lawm e hlak ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Congko dawk cungpam teh rayu lah ao, hatei laideitâtuengnae pueng teh BAWIPA e doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kâyue kâoun laihoi im dawk yikkawi e pawitonae bu hlakvah karoumcalah lahoi bukaro kam touh ca e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungkaang e san ni yeirai ka phawt e capa hah a uk teh, hmaunawnghanaw hoi cungtalah râw a coe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngun sôlêi nahanelah manang, sui sôlêi nahanelah takhuenhmai, hatei BAWIPA ni lungthin a tanouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thoenae kasaknaw ni teh laithoe dueng a thai ngai awh teh, laithoe kadeinaw ni hai laithoe lawk a thai ngai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamimathoe ka dudam e ni kasakkung a dudam teh, ayânaw runae a kâhmo navah a lungkahawi e tami hai hlout mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mincanaw teh matawngnaw e bawilukhung doeh, camonaw bawilennae teh a napanaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lawkkanem hoi tamipathu kamcu hoeh, laithoe deinae pahni teh bawi hoi hoe kamcu hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tadawnghno teh ka dâw e tami koe talung phukaawm hoi a kâvan, a kangvawi tangkuem koe hawinae a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lawkeknae ka ramuk pouh e ni lungpatawnae a tawng, hatei boutbout ka dei pouh e tami ni teh huiko a kapek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamipathu avai cum touh hem e hlak tamilungkaang vai touh yue e aphuohnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamikahawihoeh ni kâtaran nahane dueng doeh a tawng, hatdawkvah patoune kathout hoi a kâhmo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamipathu a pathu lahun nah kâhmo e hlak teh, a ca kahmat e tavom hoi kâhmo pawiteh bet ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hawinae hah thoenae hoi ka pathung e tami teh hnokathout ni a imthung tâcawt takhai mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kâyuenae teh tuiim dawk hoi tui ka yu e patetlah ao, hatdawkvah kâyue hoehnahlan kâounnae hah roun lawih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tamikayon a yon ka ngaithoum e tami hoi, tamikalan yon kapen e tami hah BAWIPA ni a panuet
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamipathu ni lungangnae a ngai hoeh dawkvah, lungangnae ran nahane hnopai hah bangkongmaw ahni kut dawk poe han vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hui ni teh nâtuek hai lung na pataw teh, hmaunawngha teh runae kâhmo tueng nahanelah doeh a khe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thaipanueknae ka tawn hoeh e niteh kuttabei kâtambei hoi a hui hmalah lawk a kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lawkeknae ka ngai e ni teh kâyuenae hai a ngai, a longkha ka rasangsak e ni rawknae hah a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dumyennae lungthin ka tawn e ni hnokahawi hmawt mahoeh, laithoe ka dei e tami teh runae hoi a kâhmo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamipathu ka khe e tami teh amahoima a lungmathoe sak, ka pathu e capa ka tawn e tami teh konawmnae tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lungthin konawm e heh kahawipoung e tâsi hoi a kâvan teh, lungthin reknae ni hru a ke sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamikathout ni lannae lamthung phen hanelah a hnukkhu lahoi hno ouk a lawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lungangnae teh thaipanueknae katawnkung hmalah ao teh, tamipathu e mit ni teh talai pout totouh ouk a khet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Capa pathu e teh na pa lung kamathoutsakkung lah ao teh, kakhekung manu hanelah hai ka khat poung e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tamikalan rek hanelah awm hoeh, ka talue e hai a hawi nahlangva hem hanelah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Panuenae ka tawn e ni lawk a kâsum teh, thaipanueknae ka tawn e teh roumnae muitha ka tawn e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamipathu hai duem awm pawiteh, tamilungkaang patetlah pouk e lah ao, a pahnicakuep pawiteh thaipanueknae ka tawn patetlah pouk e lah ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amadueng kaawm e ni ama ngainae dueng a tawng teh, lungangnae pueng hai a taran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamipathu ni thaipanueknae dawk konawmnae tawn laipalah a mae lungthin dueng a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamikathout a tho toteh dudamnae ao, yeiraiponae hoi yuenae hai hmawi ao van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami e pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e lawk teh kadung e tui patetlah ao teh, lungangnae tuikhu teh ka lawng e palang patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamikathout e minhmai khet lahoi tamikalan sung sak nahanlah lawkceng e heh hawihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamipathu e pahni dawk hoi kâyuenae lawk a tâco teh a lawk ni hemnae hah a tâcosak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamipathu e pahni teh ama rawknae lah ao teh, a pahni teh ama hanelah karap lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamcueklawk teh katuipounge rawca patetlah ao teh, von thung a thung totouh a kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thaw dawk ka pangak e teh karaphoekung e hmaunawngha lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />BAWIPA e min teh kacake imrasang lah ao, tamikalan ni a kâen teh roumnae a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami katawntanaw e tawntanae teh, amamouh pouknae dawkvah, kacake khopui, karasang e rapan lah a o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rawknae kâhmo hoehnahlan tami lungpouk a rasang teh, barinae ao hoehnahlan kârahnoumnae ouk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thai hoehnahlan lawk pathung e teh pathunae hoi yeiraiponae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tami e muitha ni a patawnae hah a khang thai, hatei muitha rek e teh apinimaw a khang thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kho ka pouk e lungthin ni panuenae hah a pang teh, tamilungkaang e hnâ ni panuenae hah a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Poehno poe e ni lam a kâko sak teh, kacuenaw hmalah na phakhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amahoima hmaloe ka kâdei e teh tamikalan lah pouk e lah ao eiteh, a imri ni akung ouk a khei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cungpam rayunae ni kâounnae a roum sak teh athakaawmnaw hah a roum sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmaunawngha lungkuep sak hoeh e teh khopui tâ e hlak aruhnawn, lawk kâounnae teh sum hoi kâtaren e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pahni dawk hoi ka tâcawt e a paw hoi a von a paha vaiteh, a pahni paw hoi a lung a kuep han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hringnae hoi duenae teh lai bahu dawk ao teh, lai ka lungpataw e ni laipaw a ca han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yu kahmawt e ni hnokahawi a hmu teh, BAWIPA koehoi ngaikhainae ka pang e tami doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamimathoe ni teh a kâhei, hatei ka tawnta e niteh lawk kahram lah ouk a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hui kapap ka tawn e teh hui kahawi lah ao van hanelah ao, hatei hmaunawngha hlak kahnai e huiko hai ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lawk ka longkawi e tamipathu hlak, mathoe laihoi yuemkamcu hringnae ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Panuenae tawn laipalah hringnae hai hawi hoeh, a khok a hue ka rang e hai a payon thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pathunae ni lamthung a payon sak teh, a lungthung hoi BAWIPA ouk a taran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnopai ni huiko moi a sak, hatei tamimathoe teh a hui ni a ceitakhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka panuekkhaikung kaphawk teh rek laipalah tâcawt mahoeh, laithoe ka dei e hai hlout mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami kapap ni bawi e lungyouk hanelah a kâcai awh, poehno ka poe e tami hai tami pueng ni a kamyawngkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamimathoe teh a hmaunawngha pueng ni hai a hmuhma, a huinaw natawng teh ahlanae koe doeh hoe ao awh, lawkkanem lahoi a pâlei ei nakunghai hoe a yawng takhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungangnae ka hmawt e ni hringnae a lungpataw teh, thaipanueknae ka pâkuem e ni hnokahawi a hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka panuekkhaikung kaphawk teh rek laipalah tâcawt mahoeh, laithoe ka dei e hai a rawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hringnawmnae heh tamipathunaw hanelah kamcu hoeh, san ni khobawi a uk e heh hoe kamcu hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Poukpanueknae ka tawn e ni a lungsaw sak teh, kâtapoenae ka pahnim pouh e teh ama ka bawilen sakkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siangpahrang lungkhuek e teh sendek ka huk e patetlah ao, hatei a ngaikhainae teh hram dawk ka bawt e tadamtui patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Capa ka pathu e teh a na pa hanelah thoenae kaphawtkung lah ao teh, lai ka roe e yu teh tui ka yu e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Im hoi tawntanae teh napanaw koehoi coe e râw doeh, hatei yu kahawi teh BAWIPA koehoi e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thathoenae ni ihmu a tho sak, ka pangak e teh a vonhlam han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kâpoelawk ka tarawi e teh a hringnae a ring, hatei ka pahnawt e teh a due han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamimathoe ka pahren e teh BAWIPA koe a cawi sak toe, a poe tangcoung e hno hah bout poe lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngaihawinae ao navah na capa hah yue haw, a kahma nahanelah pouk hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lung puenghoi ka khuek sak e ni reknae a kâhmo han, bangkongtetpawiteh, na rungngang nakunghai boutbout rungngang a ngai han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kâpankhainae hah thai haw, cangkhainae hah dâw haw, bangkongtetpawiteh, hmalah na lung a ang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami e lungthin ni hno moikapap a kâcai, hatei BAWIPA e khokhangnae dueng doeh kangning han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tami ni a ngai poung e teh pahrennae hah doeh, laithoe dei e hlak mathoe e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />BAWIPA takinae ni hringnae koe lah a ceikhai, hote hringnae ka tawn e teh a lung a kuep vaiteh, hnokathout ni thosin mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami ka pangak ni a kut a kâyap teh rawca a kâtu hane boehai ngai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka dudam e tami hah hem haw, kamawngrame tami teh a kâhlaw yawkaw han doeh, a lungkaang e tami hah yue haw patopatang han
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na pa roedeng ka poe ni teh manu ka hrek e teh, yeiraiponae hoi min mathoenae ka phawt e capa doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka capa cangkhainae thai e heh na kâhat payon pawiteh, lungangnae lamthung na phen han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cungkeihoehe kapanuekkhaikung ni lawkcengnae kalan a dudam teh, tamikathout e pahni ni payonpakainae a payawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lawkcengnae heh kadudamnaw hanelah hruek e lah ao teh, hemnae bongpai teh tamipathunaw e hnukthun hane doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Misurtui teh ayâ ni panuikhainae doeh, yamu teh kâyuenae doeh, hot patet e hno ni tami lungang sak boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Siangpahrang lungkhuek e teh sendek ka huk e patetlah ao, a lung ka khuek sak e tami teh a hringnae hanlah runae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kâyuenae karoumsakkung teh bari a kamcu, tamipathu ni kâhemnae pou a kamtawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tami ka pangak ni a pâding dawk laikawk kanawk ngaihoeh, canga toteh a ca hane banghai tawn mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami lungthin hoi pouknae teh ka dungpoung e tui hoi a kâvan, hatei thaipanueknae ka tawn e ni teh haw hoi a tâco sak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami kapap ni amamouh hawinae dueng doeh ouk a dei awh, hatei apinimaw yuemkamcu e a hmu thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikalan teh yuemkamcu lah ouk a hring, a canaw ni hai ahnie yawhawi ouk a hmawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lawkcengnae tungkhung dawk ka tahung e siangpahrang ni, a mithmu e hnokathout pueng koung a takhoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lungthin ka thoung sak toe, yon hoi ka hlout toe telah apinimaw a dei thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yawcu kânginghoehe hoi khinglung ka kuep hoeh e teh BAWIPA hmalah panuet a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Camo hai a tawk e lahoi panue thai, a tawk e hno a thoung hoi a lan e lahoi bangnue thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thaithainae hnâ hoi hmuthainae mit heh BAWIPA ni a sak e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I e hah lungpataw hanh na mathoe han, na mit pakkaw lah khenhaw! cakhuem rawca na tawn han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hno karankung ni hawihoeh ati, hatei a cei hnukkhu a ran e hah a kâoupkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sui hoi talung phukaawm moikapap ao, hatei panuenae pahni teh talung phukaawm e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamitavan hanelah amahkhankung teh angki amahkhan nahanelah la pouh lah ao vaiteh napui koe poe naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dumnae vaiyei teh a tui eiteh, a ca hnukkhu a kâko dawk sadi hoi a kawi han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Noenae heh kâpankhai hnukkhu caksak lah ouk ao, kahawicalah kâpan hnukkhu na taran hah tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Yapliyaplap kaawm e tami ni arulawk hah ouk a pâpho, hatdawkvah a lawk ka pâhnan e tami hoi kamyawng hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Apipatethai, a manu hoehpawiteh a na pa thoe ka bo e teh, khohmo um a hmaiim a due pouh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Râw hah hmaloe pang thai eiteh, apoutnae koe yawhawinae lah awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moi ka pathung han telah tet hanh, BAWIPA hah ring haw, ama ni na rungngang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khinglung kâvan hoeh e heh BAWIPA mithmu vah panuet a tho teh, kânging hoeh e yawcu hai hawihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami ceinae lamthungnaw heh BAWIPA ni a sak e doeh, hatdawkvah tami ni ama ceinae lamnaw hah bangtelamaw a panue thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hetheh poehno kathoung doeh telah lungrang laihoi dei e teh tami hanelah karap doeh, lawkkam hnukkhu pankângainae ouk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A lungkaang e siangpahrang ni tamikathoutnaw hah a kâyatsak teh lengkhok hoi a coungroe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tami e muitha teh BAWIPA e hmaiim doeh, a lungthin thung e pueng pheng a tue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lungmanae hoi lawkkatang ni siangpahrang teh a kountouk, a bawitungkhung teh lungpatawnae lahoi kangdue sak lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thoundounnaw e bawilennae teh a thaonae doeh, matawngnaw e kamcunae teh a sampo doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Puenghoi hemnae ni hno kathout a thoung sak, hemnae ni thung lah von dawk e pueng hai a thoung sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang lungthin teh tui ka lawng e patetlah ao teh, BAWIPA kut dawk ao dawkvah, a ngainae koe lah a lawng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ma e hmunae dawk teh mae hringnuen heh a lan telah pouk awh, hatei BAWIPA ni lungthin heh yawcu dawk a khing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lannae hoi kânging lah sak e heh thuengnae hlak BAWIPA ni a ngaihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kâoupnae minhmai hoi lunglennae lungthin hoi tamikathoutnaw e hmaiim teh yon doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami ka hratbat e pouknae ni tawntannae a tâcokhai, hatei kâhruetcuet hoeh e pouknae ni voutnae a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Laithoe dei laihoi hmu e hnopai teh duenae ka tawng ni teh kahmat e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw e lawpnae ni amamouh a raphoe han, bangkongtetpawiteh kânginglah lawkcengnae hah a pahnawt awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamikayon e lamthung teh a longkawi, hatei tamikalan hanelah teh a tawk e hah kalan e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hrawang e yu hoi im kalen dawk o hlak teh, lemphu imtakin koe awm pawiteh bet ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tamikathout hringnae ni hnokathout a ngai, a imrinaw ni ahnie pahrennae hmawt awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kadudame taminaw reknae dawkvah kamawngrame ni lungang a kâla awh, hatei tamilungkaangnaw cangkhai navah panuenae a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamikalan ni tamikathout imthung hah kahawicalah a pouk, hatei Cathut ni tamikathoutnaw teh amamae thoenae lahoi a tâkhawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamimathoe hramnae lawk thai ngai laipalah a hnâ ka tabuem e teh, ama hai a hram toteh apinihai thai pouh mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Arulahoi poe e poehno ni lungphuennae, a lungtabue dawk poe e tadawnghno ni puenghoi lungkhueknae a roum sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kalan lah lawkcengnae e teh tamikalan hanelah konawmnae doeh, hatei yonnae kasaknaw teh rawknae koe a pha awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thaipanueknae lam kaphennaw teh tamikadoutnaw kamkhuengnae koe a kâhat van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nawmnae dueng ka ngai e teh a mathoe han, misurtui hoi satui ka ngai poung e teh tawnta mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tamikathout teh tamikalan hanelah, Yuemkamcuhoeh e teh tamikalan ratangnae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lungkaduem ni teh ka hrawang e yu hoi o hlak teh, ramkenae koe awm pawiteh bet ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamilungkaang onae koe hno ngai kaawm hoi satui ao teh, tamipathu ni teh a kaseikasak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lannae hoi lungmanae katawngnaw ni hringnae hoi lannae hoi barinae ouk a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamilungkaang ni kacakpounge khopui dawk a kâen teh, khocanaw ni a kângue e rapanim hah a tip sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A laihoi a pahni ka ring e teh runae thung hoi a hringnae ouk a hlout.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami moikai hoi kâoup e teh a min patenghai dudamkung telah a phung awh teh, kâoup lungkhuek laihoi ouk a kâroe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami ka pangak e teh thaw a tawk ngaihoeh dawkvah, a doun e ni ama a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnintangkuem nôe laihoi ao, hatei tamikalan niteh pasai laipalah a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tamikathout e thuengnae teh panuet a tho, hnokathout ngainae lungthin hoi thuengnae teh panuet hoe a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kapanuekkhaikung kaphawk teh takhoe lah ao han, hatei kapanuekkhaikung katang ni a panue e patetlah a dei e teh dâw lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tamikathout ni a minhmai tamundun lah a ta, hatei tamikalan ni a lamthung a cak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />BAWIPA taranlahoi lungangnae, thaipanueknae, hoi kâpankhainae awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Marangtan teh tarantuk hnin hanelah rakueng lah ao, tânae teh BAWIPA e doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnopai moikapap hlak hai minhawinae heh rawi hanelah ao, tangka hoi sui hlak hai ayâ ni pahrennae heh ngaihnawn hanelah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami ka tawnta hoi tamimathoe rei a tawn roi e teh, BAWIPA teh bangpueng kasakkung doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kâhruetcuet e ni teh hnokathout a hmu navah a kâhro, hatei kamawngrame ni teh a ceisin teh rek e lah ouk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kârahnoumnae hoi BAWIPA takinae ni tawntanae hoi barinae hoi hringnae a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lam longkawi dawk teh pâkhing hoi karap ao teh, a hringnae lamthung ka ring e teh hotnaw hoi ahlanae koe doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Camo ni a dawn hane lamthung pâtu haw, a matawng to hai phen mahoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tami ka tawnta ni tamimathoe a uk, ka câwi e tami teh kacâwisakkung koe san lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Payonpakainae cati ka tu e ni lungmathoenae a a vaiteh, a lungkhueknae sonron a khoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pahrennae mit ka tawn e teh yawhawi a coe han, bangkongtetpawiteh tamimathoenaw ouk a kawk toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dudamnaw pâlei haw kâounnae tang a roum han, kâyuenae hoi kâpakungnae hai a roum han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lungthin ka thoung e teh, kamcu e lawk a dei dawkvah siangpahrang e hui kahawicalah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />BAWIPA mit ni panuenae a kountouk, hatei yuemnae ka tawn hoeh e lawk teh ouk a takhoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pangak e tami ni alawilah sendek ao, lam vah na kei han doeh, ouk a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Napui kahawihoehe pahni teh kadunge tangkom doeh, BAWIPA ni a panuet e teh hawvah a bo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathunae heh camo lungthin dawk a kâbet teh, yuenae bongpai ni ahlanae koe ouk a pâlei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ma mek nahanelah tamimathoenaw ka rektap e hoi, katawntanaw ka poe e tami teh hoehoe a mathoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamilungkaangnaw e lawk heh kahawicalah thai nateh, na lungthin hoi kaie lungangnae hah dâw haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, na thung hoi na pâkuem pawiteh hothateh lunghawinae doeh, na pahni dawk pou awm seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hottelahoi BAWIPA teh na kâuep thai han, sahnin vah nang koe na panuesak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kâpankhainae hoi panuenae kahawi poung e hah na thut pouh toe nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nang ni lawkkatang katang na panue vaiteh, nang koe patoun e naw hah lawkkatang lawk bout na dei pouh thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mathoenaw e mathoenae hah thakâla hoi ahnie hno lawm hanh, ka cunathoehnaw hai kho longkha koe coungroe hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, BAWIPA ni ahnimae kong a pouk han doeh, ahnimae hno kalawmnaw e hringnae a lawp pouh van han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A lungkaduem e tami hah kamyawngkhai hanh, a lungkhuek thai poung e tami hai kamyawngkhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahnimae nuen na kamtu vaiteh, na hringnae a kâman han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kut tambei e taminaw hoi laiba patho pouh hanelah lawk kâkam e taminaw koe bawk van hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Patho nahane na tawn hoeh pawiteh, na ikhun tawm awh vaiteh oun na la pouh awh han nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na mintoenaw ni ung e khori hah takhoe hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thaw kahawicalah ka tawk ni teh ka cuem e na hmu boi ou, siangpahrangnaw hmalah hai a kangdue han doeh, tami rumram e hmalah kangdout mahoeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khobawinaw hoi rawca rei na ca toteh, na hmalah apimaw ka tahung tie kahawicalah pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kâso e lah na awm pawiteh, tahloi hoi na lawkron hah nue haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atuinae dueng pouk hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh dumyennae rawca doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawnta hanelah kâcai hanh, na panuenae kâuep hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka coung thai hoeh e hah na ngaihawi kawi namaw. Tawntanae ni amahmawk rathei a sak teh mataw patetlah kahlun lah koung a kamleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Utsinnaw e rawca cat pouh hanh, ahnie rawcanaw hai nôe pouh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, a lung hoi a pouk e patetlah doeh ao, cat nateh net ati nakunghai a lungthin teh nang koe awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ca e hai na palo vaiteh, na oupnae hai a hrawnghrang lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamipathu thainae koe lawk dei hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh na lungangnae lawk hah banglahai noutna mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ayan e khori hai takhoe hanh, naranaw e ram hai lawm hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh ratangkung teh a tha ao, ahnimouh koelah kampang lahoi na taran payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cangkhainae koelah na lungthin poe nateh, panuenae lawk thainae koe na hnâpakeng haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Camo hah yue laipalah awm hanh, hem yawkaw dout mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bongpai hoi hem nateh a hringnae hah sheol dawk hoi rungngang haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka capa na lungang pawiteh, ka lung ahawi katang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bokheiyah, na pahni ni lawk kalan dei pawiteh, ka lung ahawi katang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungthin ni tamikayon nôe hanh naseh, hatei kanîruirui BAWIPA takinae tawn haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, apoutnae teh ka phat han, na ngaihawi e teh ahrawnghrang lah awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka capa thai nateh lungang haw, na lungthin teh lamkalan dawk tat haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Misurtui kâsonaw hah kamyawngkhai hanh, moi kâsonaw hai kamyawngkhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, yamuhri hoi moi kâso e teh a mathoe han, iparuinae ni tami napon a kâkhusak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kakhekung na pa e lawk hah ngâi nateh, na matawng toteh na manu dudam hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lawkkatang hah ran nateh yawt hanh, lungangnae hai, cangkhainae hai, thaipanueknae hai a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tamikalan ni a na pa puenghoi a lunghawisak, capa lungkaang ka khe e hai a lunghawi katang han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na manu hoi na pa teh lunghawi hoi awm awh naseh, kakhekung hai lunghawi naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka capa na lungthin na poe haw, na mit ni ka onae nuen khen naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kâyawt e teh kadung poung e tangkom doeh, kahlong lae napui hai kabueng e tuikhu doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A man thai e naw hah ouk a pawp, tongpa naw koe yuemkamcuhoehnae ouk a pungsak
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Apimaw a lung ka mathout, apimaw kângaikâthung, apimaw ayâ hoi kâyue, apimaw ka phuenang, apimaw a khuekhaw awm laipalah hmâ ka cat, apimaw a mit ka paling tetpawiteh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Yamu koe pou kaawm niteh, yamu aphunphun ouk kalawt e taminaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka paling e yamu hah khen hanh, manang dawk kamlaw niteh, kamcu e yamu hah khen lah boehai khen hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Apoutnae koe tahrun patetlah na khuek vaiteh, hrunthok patetlah na khue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na mit ni napuinaw kathoute hmawt vaiteh, na lungthin ni lawk longkawi a dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bokheiyah, talî dawk ka ip e patetlah na awm vaiteh, long dawk yap e hni van ka ip e patetlah doeh na awm ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na hem awh teh pataw hoeh, na tam awh ei ka panuek hoeh, nâtuek vaimoe ka kâhlaw vaiteh bout ka parui han vai na ti han doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamikayonnaw hah nôe awh hanh, ahnimouh koehai kambawng hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, rawk nahane dueng a pouk awh teh, runae kâhmo nahan dueng doeh a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungangnae hoi im sak lah ao teh, thaipanueknae lahoi caksak lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thoumthainae lahoi rakhannaw teh aphukaawm niteh ngai kaawm e hnonaw hoi a kawisak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamilungkaang e teh a tha ao, panuenae ka tawn e ni a tha ao sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, lungkaangnaw hoi kâpankhai e lahoi na taran na tâ vaiteh kâpankhaikung a papnae koe hloutnae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungangnae heh tamipathu hanelah teh a rasang poung dawkvah, kho longkha koe dei hane panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thoenae sak hanelah kâcai e tami teh, thoenae khokhankung telah kaw lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamipathunaw e pouknae teh yonnae doeh, ayâ ka dudam e teh ayâ hanelah panuet a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Runae na kâhmo navah na lungpout pawiteh, na tha a youn han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Due hanelah a hrawi awh e hah rungngang awh nateh, thei hanelah a hrawi awh e hah ratang awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thai haw, hetteh ka panuek hoeh, na tet pawiteh, na lungthin yawcu dawk kakhingkung ni pouk mahoeh namaw. Na hringnae kountoukkung ni panuek mahoeh na maw. Tamipueng a tawk awh e patetlah patho mahoeh namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka capa khoitui hah cat haw, bangkongtetpawiteh ahawi, ka radip e khoipha hah cat haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hot patetlah, panuenae hoi lungangnae hai na hringnae hanlah tho van seh. Hot hah na hmawt pawiteh ngaihawi hane ao teh na ngaihawinae teh ayawmyin lah awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Oe tamikathout, tamikalan onae im hah pawm hanh, a kâhatnae hmuen hai raphoe hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tamikalan teh vaisari touh ka rawm nakunghai bout a thaw hah, hatei tamikathout teh rawknae koe a rawp han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na taran a rawp navah na konawm hanh, a kamthui navah na lunghawi hanh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatnavah, BAWIPA ni hmawt vaiteh, a lunghawi hoeh langvaih, hahoi ahni koe a lungkhueknae hai a roum sak thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thoenae kasaknaw kecu dawk na lungpuen hanh, tamikathoutnaw hai ut hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tamikathoutnaw hanelah ngaihawinae awm hoeh, tamikathoutnaw e hmaiim teh padue pouh lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka capa, BAWIPA hoi siangpahrang teh taket haw, kaletkalang kaawm e hah kamyawngkhai hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, vaitahoi rawknae a pha han, ahnimouh roi e rawknae teh apinimaw a panue thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Het hai tamilungkaangnaw e doeh, lawkceng nah tami kapek e teh hawi hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tamikathout koe, nang teh na lan, ka tet e teh, tamipueng ni thoebo vaiteh miphun pueng ni a panuet han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatei, tamikathout ka yue e teh kabawpnae a tawn han, a lathueng yawhawinae kahawi a pha han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kalan lah ka pato e pahni teh tami pueng ni a paco han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Alawilah na thaw hah kâcai haw, law thaw tawk hanelah kâcai haw, hathnukkhu na im hah sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A khuekhaw awm laipalah na imri taranlahoi kapanuekkhaikung lah awm hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh na pahni hoi na dum han namaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahni ni kai dawk a sak e patetlah ahni dawk ka sak han, amae moi rueng ka pathung han telah tet hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka pangak law ka cei teh, thaipanueknae ka tawn hoeh naw e misur takha koe ka cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pâkhing ni king a kayo, pho king a cak, rapan koung a tip toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka khet teh kahawicalah ka pouk, cangkhainae ao telah ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Dongdeng ka yan ei nei, dongdeng ka ip ei nei, kut tapam laihoi kâhat einei na ti lahun nah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />mathoenae ni imyin patetlah tho vaiteh, na voutnae teh ransa patetlah a tho han.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hethaiyah, Solomon e cingthuilawk, Judah siangpahrang Hezekiah e taminaw ni patuen a thut awh e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hro e hno teh Cathut bawilennae doeh, hatei hno pakhingpalang e teh siangpahrang bawilennae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kalvan a rasang teh talai a dung e patetlah siangpahrang lungthin hai koung panuek thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngun ei hah takhoe haw, kahlunkung ni manang kahawi a sak thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siangpahrang hmalah hoi tamikathout hah takhoe pawiteh, a bawitungkhung teh lannae lahoi a cak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Siangpahrang hmalah mahoima kârasang sak hanh, siangpahrang hmuen koe hai kangdout hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mit ni a hmu e bawitungkhung hmalah pahoung hanelah puen e lah na o hlak teh, hi tho, telah kaw e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lawkcengnae hmuen koe karanglah cet hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh, na imrinaw ni yeirai na po sak vaiteh bangtelamaw na ti han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na imri hoi na lawk teh kâpankhai awh nateh, arulawk hah ayânaw koe dei awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hoehpawiteh ka thai e ni hoe pâpho vaiteh, yeirai na ponae hah hoe kamnuek langvaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kamculah dei e lawk teh ngun manang dawk e suipaw hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kahawicalah yuenae ka tarawi e tami teh, suihnapacap hoi sôlêi e sui hoi kamthoup e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kapatounkung hanelah yuemkamcu lah kaawm e patoune teh canganae tadamtui patetlah ao, bangkongtetpawiteh a bawi lung a roum sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka poe han tihoi a kâoup hnukkhu poe laipalah kaawm e tami teh, khotui laipalah e tâmai hoi kahlî hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungsawnae ni lawkcengkung a tâ thai, lawkkanem ni hru a khoe thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khoitui na hmu boimaw, na boum totouh duengma cat. Na kâso pawiteh na palo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na imri koe ekvoi cet hanh, na hmawt vaiteh na hmuhma payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A imri taranlahoi panuekkhaikung kaphawk lah kaawm e tami teh, bongpai, tahloi, kahran e pala hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Runae kâhmo lahun nah yuemkamcu hoeh e kâuep e teh, hâ kâkhoenae, hru kamhoutnae patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lungkamathout koe la ka sak e teh pâding nah angki ka rading e hoi hmâ dawk longtui awi e hawi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na taran a vonhlam pawiteh, a ca hane rawca poe nateh tui kahran pawiteh nei hane tui poeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hottelah na sak pawiteh a lû dawk hmaisaan na pâpawp pouh e lah ao teh, BAWIPA ni tawkphu na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Atunglah e kahlî ni kho a thokhai teh, tamcuek lawk deinae lai ni lungkhueknae minhmai a thokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hrawk'ang e yu hoi im kalen dawk o hlak teh, lemphu imtakin koe o e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahlanae koe e kamthang kahawi thai e heh, tuikahran e tami koe tuipading hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tamikathout hmalah tamikalan lawk dei payon e teh tui pânut e, kapawk e tuikhu hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khoitui ek kapap ca e hawi hoeh, hot patetlah mahoima bawilennae tawng e teh bawilennae nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ma e muitha ka uk thai hoeh e teh rapan tawn laipalah karawk e khopui hoi a kâvan
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kawmpoi e tadamtui hoi canganae kho patetlah, tamipathu hoi barinae kamcu hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kamleng rumram e pusu hoi pingpit patetlah, a khuekhaw awm laipalah thoebo e teh api koehai bawt mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Marang hanelah ruibongpai, la hanelah kammoumrui, tamipathu e keng hanelah bongpai teh a kamcu doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamipathu teh a pathunae patetlah pato hanh, hoehpawiteh ama patetlah na awm payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamipathu teh a pathunae patetlah pato, hoehpawiteh a lungkaang lah kâpouk payon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tamipathu koe lawk ka thui e tami teh amae khok ka tâtueng ni teh rawknae tui ka net e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khokkhem e khoktakan a kânging hoeh e patetlah, tamipathu e pahni dawk cingthuilawk teh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tamipathu bari e teh tâyaicung dawk hluemhluem kawm e patetlah doeh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamipathunaw ni dei e cingthuilawk teh yamuhri kut dawk ka um e pâkhing hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangpuengpa kasakkung lentoe Cathut ni tamipathu hoi kâtapoe kung aphu a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ui ni a palo bout a ca e patetlah tamipathu ni a pathunae hah a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama pouknae dawk tamilungkaang lah ka kâpouk e na hmu ou. Hote tami koehoi hlak teh tamipathu koehoi ngaihawinae bet aohnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami pangak ni, lam dawk sendek ao, thongma vah sendek ao telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tho teh takhang dawk a kâhei e patetlah tami pangak teh ikhun dawk a kâhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami pangak ni rawca a kâyap teh a kâtu hane boehai ngai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka pangak e ni, kahawicalah khopouk thai e tami sari touh hlak ka lunganghnawn telah a kâpouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Yuengyoe cei lahoi ayânaw e kong dawk ka bawk e tami teh ui hnâ ka kuen e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pacai e doeh na a tihoi, a imri ka dum e tami teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hmaito, pala, duenae hoi ka ka e tamipathu hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thing awm hoehpawiteh hmai a roum e patetlah, tamcueklawk deinae awm hoehpawiteh kâyuenae hai a roum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmaisaan ni hmaisaei a kamtawi sak, thing ni hmai a kak sak e patetlah, kâoun ka ngai e ni kâyuenae a kamtawi sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamcueklawk teh katuipounge rawca patetlah ao teh, von thung a kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Apâhni pâhnan hoi lungthinkathout e tami teh, talai hlaam ngun hoi pâbing e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami hmuhmanae ka tawn e tami ni a pahni hoi a hro teh, a lung thung dumyennae hah a hro.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pahren lahoi, ati ei nakunghai yuem hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh a lungthung vah panuettho e sari touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hmuhmanae hah dumnae lahoi ka hrawk nakunghai, thoenae teh tamimaya ni panuenae koe kamnue sak lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tangkom kataikung teh a tai e tangkom dawk a bo han, talung kapaletkung koe talung bout a kamlei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Laithoe ka dei e ni a rektap e naw hah ouk a hmuhma, oupnae kaphawk ni rawknae a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tangtho e hnin hanlah kâoup hanh, bangkongtetpawiteh bangmaw a tâcokhai han tie na panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Namahoima laipalah ayâ ni na pholen naseh, nama e pahni ni laipalah alouke ni na pholen naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Talung hai a ri teh sadi hai a ri, hatei tamipathu lungkhueknae teh hotnaw hlak a ri hnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungkhueknae teh a mathoe, lungphuennae teh a matheng, hatei utnae teh apinimaw a khang thai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hro e lungpatawnae hlak teh hmantang yue e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmâ na ka paca e hui teh yuem a kamcu, hatei taran ni na paco e teh dumyennae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A von ka paha tangcoung e ni teh khoipha patenghai ngai mahoeh toe, hatei a von ka hlam e tami hanelah teh kakhat e patenghai a radip.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ma e imlaw ka palum ngai hoeh e teh, tava a tabu dawk kaawm ngai hoeh e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Satui hoi hmuitui ni lungthin a konawm sak teh, hui kahawi ni pouknae na poe e ni hringnae konawm sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na pa e hui hoi nama e hui kapek hanh, runae na kâhmo navah na hmaunawngha im kuekluek cet hanh, ahlanae koe e na hmaunawngha hlak teh a hnainae koe e na hui a hawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ka pacekpahlek e ka pathung thai nahanlah ka capa, lungang haw, ka lungthin konawm sak haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamilungkaang ni thoenae hah sut a hmu teh a kâhro, kamawngrame ni teh a kâphumsin teh rek e lah ouk ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamitavan hanelah amahkhankung teh a angki amahkhan nahanelah la pouh lah ao vaiteh napui koe poe naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amom a thaw teh kacaipounglah a hui yawhawi ka poe e teh, thoebonae lah pouk pouh lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lai pou ka roe e yu teh, Puenghoi khonan hnin e khoramei hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote napui ka pâkuem e teh, kahlî ka pâkuem niteh, aranglae kut dawk satui kasum e hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sum teh sum hoi doeh letlang hran sak thai, hot patetlah tami ni a hui e a minhmai ouk a pan sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thaibunglung kung ka tawn e pueng ni thaibunglung paw a ca han, hot patetlah a bawi e thaw ka tawk e teh bari lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui dawk coungnae a kamnue, hot patetlah tami lungthin ni tami a kamnue sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sheol hoi rawkkahmanae teh khout boihoeh, hot patetlah tami e mit ni a khout tie tawn boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sôlêinae manang teh ngun hanelah, takhuenhmai teh sui hanelah ao. Tami teh oup e lahoi a bawilennae panue lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamipathu teh sumdawk cakang hoi mek ka phawm nakunghai a pathunae ni cettakhai pawm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na tuhu kong panue nahanlah panki loe, na saringhu hah kahawicalah a kountouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, tawntanae heh a yungyoe kangning hoeh, hoehpawiteh bawilukhung heh se pueng dawk kangning hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Phonaw hai a pâw, catinaw hai a pâw, law e a pawnaw hai khue lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tunaw ni na khohna hane hmaenaw ni lawhmuen ran nahane ouk a thokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang ni na ca hane, imthungnaw ca hane, sannunaw ca hanelah hmae sanutui teh a khout han doeh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tamikathout teh apinihai pâlei hoeh eiteh a yawng, hatei tamikalan teh sendek patetlah a taran ahawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khocanaw lawkeknae kecu dawk khobawinaw tuhoitu a kâthung awh, hatei thaipanueknae hoi panuenae katawnnaw kecu dawk ram a kangning han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tamimathoe ni tamimathoe repcoungroe e teh ca hane pek laipalah ka cetkhai e longhotui hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kâlawk ka cettakhai e ni tamikathout a pholen, hatei kâlawk ka tarawi ni ouk a tuk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw ni lannae thaipanuek awh hoeh, hatei BAWIPA katawngnaw ni bangpueng hai a thaipanuek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tawnta laihoi a khuekhaw awm laipalah hring hlak teh tamimathoe yuemkamculah kaawm e ahawihnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kâlawk ka tarawi e teh a lungkaang e capa doeh, ka kâso e hoi kamyawng e ni a na pa yeirai a po sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Apung ka cat ni teh kalan hoeh e lahoi hnopai ka tawnta e ni tamimathoe kabawmkung hanelah a pâtung pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kâlawk ka tarawi ngai hoeh e teh a ratoumnae hai panuet a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thoenae lam dawk tamikalan lam ka phen sak e teh ama ni a tai e tangkom dawk a bo han, hatei toun kaawm hoeh e ni hnokahawi a coe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tawnta e ni amahoima a lungkaang lah a kâpouk, hatei thaipanueknae ka tawn e tamimathoe ni peng a pâpho han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tamikalan a lunghawi navah kalen e bawilennae ao, hatei tamikathout a kangdue toteh taminaw a kâhro awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amae yonae ka hrawk e teh hawinae hmawt mahoeh, hatei ka pâpho e ni pahrennae a hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Takinae pou ka tawn e teh a yawkahawi e doeh, hatei a lung pou ka patak e teh rawkkahmanae hoi a kâhmo han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mathoenaw kaukkung bawi kathout teh sendek ka huk e hoi tavom ka hram e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thaipanueknae ka vout e ukkung niteh rep a coungroe hatei hounlounnae ka hmuhma e ukkung teh a hringsaw han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tamikathet e teh phuen tangkom koe yawng na lawiseh, apinihai ngang nahan seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lam kalan dawk ka dawn e tami teh a hlout han, hatei lam longkawi dawk ka dawn e teh vaitalahoi a rawp han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laikawk ka thawn e teh rawca moi a tawn han, hatei ayawmyinlah kaawm e tami teh a mathoe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Yuemkamcu e ni yawhawinae kapap a hmu han, hatei dongdengca dawk tawnta hanelah kâcai e teh rek laipalah awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Minhmai khet tawnnae teh hawi hoeh, vaiyei tangen kecu dawk tami kâlawk ouk a tapoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dongdengca dawk tawnta hanelah kâcai e tami teh thoenae mit a tawn, bout mathoe han doeh tie pouk hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tami ka oup e hlak teh tami ka yue e ni a hnukkhu pholennae a coe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A manu hoi a na pa hno ka lawm niteh, kâtapoenae nahoeh ka tet e tami teh, karaphoekung e hui doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami kâoup e lungthin ni kâyuenae a tâcokhai, hatei BAWIPA kâuep e teh a lamcawn han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amae pouknae ka kâuep e teh tamipathu doeh, hatei lungang lahoi kaawm e teh hlout lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tamimathoenaw hno ka poe e teh vout mahoeh, hatei ka roun e tami teh puenghoi thoebonae a hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamikathoutnaw a kangdue toteh taminaw amahmawk a kâhro awh, hatei a rawk awh toteh tamikalannaw a pung awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Voutsout yue eiteh a lahuen ka patak sak e tami teh, hawinae awm laipalah hmawi a rawk han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamikalan ni kâtawnnae a tawn toteh tamimaya a konawm awh, hatei tamikathout ni a uk navah tamimaya a cingou awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungangnae ka ngai e ni a na pa a konawm sak, hatei kâyawt e hoi kamyawng e tami ni a hnopai koung a pâbaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang ni lawkcengnae lahoi ram a caksak, hatei tadawnghno ni ram a rawk sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A imri laithoe lahoi ka oup e teh a khok kâman nahanlah tamlawk a yangda pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kâtapoenae ni tamikathout a man, hatei tamikalan teh la sak lahoi a lunghawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tamikalan ni tamimathoe hanlah a pouk, hatei tamikathout ni teh banglahai noutna hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kadudamnaw ni khopui hmai a sawi, hatei tamilungkaang ni teh lungkhueknae a takhoe thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamilungkaang ni tamipathu hoi kâyue pawiteh, tamipathu a panui hai thoseh, a lungphuen hai thoseh banglahai tho hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami kathetnaw ni tamikalan a hmuhma awh, tamikalan teh hawinae hah a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tamipathu ni a pouk e pueng hah a dei, hatei tamilungkaang ni teh a panguep.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ukkung ni laithoe dei e banghai nahoeh tet pawiteh, a sannaw pueng teh tamikathout lah koung a coung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tamimathoe hoi repcoungroenaw ni cungtalah a hmawng e teh, BAWIPA ni a mit reirei a ang sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Atangcalah tamimathoe hanelah lawkcengkung siangpahrang teh, a bawitungkhung a yungyoe caksak lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bongpai hoi yuenae ni tami a lungangsak teh, ka pangak e camo ni a manu yeirai a po sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamikathout apapnae koe kâtapoenae apap, hatei tamikalan ni a rawk awh e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na capa hah yue yaw lannae na poe han, hothloilah hring nawmnae na poe han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vision ohoehnae koe tami pueng a thathoe awh, hatei kâlawk ka tarawi e teh tami yawkahawi e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />San teh lawk hoi dueng yue thai lah awm hoeh, bangkongtetpawiteh a thai eiteh tarawi laipalah ao thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pouk laipalah lawk ka deirumram e ouk na hmu ou, hot patet e tami koe hlak teh tamipathu koe ngaihawine bet aohnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Camo nah ekvoi pahren e san teh a cue torei teh calan e lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lung ka khuek e ni kâyuenae a tâcokhai teh, ka matheng e ni kâtapoenae pou a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ma e kâoupnae ni na rahnoumsak han, hatei muitha lahoi kârahnoum e ni barinae a coe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tamru hoi kamyawng e teh amae hringnae ka hmuhma e tami doeh, lawkkatang dei hanelah thoe a kâbo ei dei kalawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tami barinae ni karap patetlah na man, hatei BAWIPA kâuep e teh rungngang lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tami kapap ni ukkungnaw e lungyouknae hah a tawng awh, hatei taminaw hanelah lawkcengnae teh BAWIPA koehoi doeh a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tamikalanhoehe teh tamikalan hanelah panuet a tho e patetlah, tamikalan teh tamikalanhoehnaw hanelah panuet a tho van.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakeh capa Agur ni a dei e lawk. Ama ni Ithiel, Ithiel hoi Ucal koe hettelah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamipueng hlak tamipathu poung lah ka o teh, thaipanueknae hai ka tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungangnae hai kamtu van hoeh niteh, tamikathoungnaw e panuenae hai ka tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kalvan ka luen ni teh ka kum e teh apimaw, Talai poutnae pueng kacaksakkung teh apimaw, A min apimaw, a capa min hai apimaw, na panue maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cathut lawk pueng teh a thoung, ka kânguenaw pueng hanelah kânguenae lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lawk hah thap hanh, hoehpawiteh na yue vaiteh, na laithoe e hah a hmu han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hno kahni touh ka hei han, ka due hoehnahlan na poe haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahrawnghrang hoi laithoenae heh kai hoi ahlanae koe na tat pouh haw, mathoenae nakunghai, tawntanae nakunghai na poe hanh, ka panki e rawca hoi na kawk haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hoehpawiteh ka tawnta vaiteh na pahnawt payon vaih, BAWIPA teh apimaw, ka tet payon vaih. Hoehpawiteh, ka mathoe vaiteh hno ka parawt vaiteh Cathut min ka mathout sakpayon vaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />San teh a bawi koe pathoe hanh, hoehpawiteh thoe na bo vaiteh, nang dawk yonnae ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A na pa thoe a bo teh a manu yawhawi a poe ngaihoehnae se ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama mithmu vah kathoung poung lah kâpouknae ao, hatei a khinnae koehoi pâsu hoeh rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khopouk ka rasang ni teh moungnae a o, a khopouk teh a rasang katang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hâ teh sendek patetlah, a hâkamnaw teh sarai patetlah a onae se a o, het talai van e tami mathoenaw hoi kavoutthoupnaw hah koung ca hanelah kakâcainaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tavat ni canu kahni touh a tawn teh, na poe na poe a ti. Ka boum thai hoeh e kathum touh ao. A khout toe ka tet boihoeh e hno pali touh a o
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tangkom, kating e thun, tui ka boum hoeh e talai, a khout toe ka tet boihoeh e hmai naw hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A na pa ka dudam niteh a manu banglah ka noutna hoeh naw e mit teh, vonga ni a cawngkhawi pouh vaiteh, matawcanaw ni a ca awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kai hanlah kângairu hno kathum touh a o, ka thaipanuek hoeh e hno pali touh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kahlî dawk mataw kamlengnae lamthung, Lungphen van tahrun ceinae, tuipui van long ceinae, hoi thoundoun ni tangla painae lam naw hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Napui kahawihoeh hai hottelah doeh ao van, a ca hnukkhu a pahni a hui teh yonnae ka sak hoeh, telah ouk a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hno kathum touh kecu talai heh taki hoi ouk a pâyaw, bokheiyah, hno pali touh khang thai hoeh e ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Siangpahrang lah kâsak e san, king ka boum e tamipathu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vâ ka sak e napui kathout, a bawipa e yu ka khawng e sannu hetnaw hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Talaivan a thoungca eiteh a lungkaang e hno pali touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Atha awm hoeh eiteh kompawi vah ama hane rawca ka pâtung e lungkhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a tha ayoun eiteh lungha rahak kaawm e saveh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />siangpahrang tawn hoeh eiteh ahuhu lahoi ka cet e samtong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />a khok hoi a kâbang eiteh siangpahrang im kaawm e bombanaw hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hno kathum touh kahawicalah ka cet thai e a o, bokheiyah pali touh hah teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Saring pueng dawk athakaawme sendek, bang ni hai ngang thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ransa marang, hmaetan, apinihai ngang thai hoeh e siangpahrang hetnaw hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mahoima kâtalue totouh na pathu pawiteh, hoehpawiteh hnokathout sak hanelah na kâcai pawiteh, na kut hoi na pahni tabuemh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, maitosanutui kalaw e ni sanutuikamkak a tâcosak e patetlah, hnawng kapennae ni hnawngthi a lawng sak. Hot patetlah lungkhueknae ni kâyuenae a tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang Lemuel lawk, a manu ni a cangkhai e naw teh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangtelane ka capa, bangtelane ka khe e capa, bangtelane ka lawkkam capa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siangpahrangnaw patenghai karaphoekung napui koe na thaonae poe hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lemuel, misurtui nei e hoi yamu nei e teh siangpahrangnaw hane nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hoehpawiteh, net awh vaiteh kâlawk pahnim awh vaiteh mathoenaw hanelah kalanhoehe lah lawkceng awh langvaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Meimei kadout e hah yamu pânei awh nateh, lungrei ka thai e hah misurtui pânei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Net awh naseh, a reithainae hah pahnim awh naseh, a lungmathoenae pahnim totouh net awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lawkanaw hanlah dei pouh nateh, due hanelah lawk tâtueng pouh e naw hane hai dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kalan lah lawkceng nateh tamimathoe hoi tamikavout hanlah kâhet pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Yu kahawi apinimaw a hmu thai han. Bangkongtetpawiteh talung phukaawm hlak hai aphuohnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A vâ ni a lungthin hoi a kâuep teh hawinae awm laipalah awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hring nathung thoenae laipalah hawinae dueng doeh a sak pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tumuen hoi pahla hah a tawng teh a kut hoi amahmawk ouk a tawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hno ka yawt e long patetlah ao teh, ahlanae koehoi rawca ouk a thokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amom a thaw teh a imthungnaw hah rawca a paca teh, a sannunaw hah thaw rip a boun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lawhmuen hah a khet teh a ran, a tawkphu hoi misur takha a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A keng dawk tha a kâyeng teh, a kuttha hai a patung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hno a yo e a mek tie a panue dawkvah tangmin patenghai hmaiim dout hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kut hoi rahakut a kuet teh, avanglae kut hoi yâcung a kuet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tamimathoe hanelah a kut a kâyap, bokheiyah kavoutnaw totouh a kut ni koung a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tadamtui ka bawt nakunghai a imthungnaw hanelah taki hane awm hoeh, bangkongtetpawiteh a imthungnaw ni dikpalingca e khohna kabet e a khohna awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama hanlah hni a kawng teh, loukloukkaang e hoi pu doeh a khohna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A vâ hai kho longkha koe khobawinaw hoi a tahung toteh mithmaiben e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Loukloukkaang e hni a kawng teh a yo, hno kayawtnaw koe taisawm hah a yo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kawng e khohna teh a khaw, ahawi dawkvah ahni teh hmalah a konawm han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungangnae hoi lawk a dei, a lawk teh pahrennae kâlawk lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A imthung khosaknae kahawicalah koung a khetyawt, rawca hai pamda laihoi cat boihoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A canaw a thaw awh teh a manu koe a lunghawi awh. A vâ ni hai a oup van,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />napui kapap ni kahawicalah a tawk awh toe, hatei nang ni ahnimanaw na tapuet toe, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Raimonae teh dumnae doeh, meihawinae hai a yawmyin doeh. Hatei BAWIPA ka taket e napui teh oup lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A kut hoi a tawk e a paw hah poe awh nateh, longkha koe ama roeroe hah a tawk e ni oup naseh.
  </para>
</usx>
